 4.8/5 \\\\u2022 18,400+ reviews</span><span class='badge-float r'>Best seller: Studio Deluxe Mat \\\\u2014 $29.95</span><span>Studio-grade mats, blocks, straps, bolsters &amp; bulk kits</span></div></div></div><div class='trust'><div class='wrap trust-grid'><div><b>25+ yrs</b>Serving the yoga community</div><div><b>2M+</b>Mats &amp; props shipped</div><div><b>12,000+</b>Studios &amp; gyms supplied</div><div><b>30 days</b>Free, no-hassle returns</div></div></div><section><div class='wrap'><h2>Best sellers this week</h2><p class='sub'>Real gear, real prices. Most orders leave our warehouse within 24 hours.</p><div class='cards'><div class='card'><div class='thumb t1'><span class='flag'>Save 25%</span>\\\\ud83e\\\\uddd8</div><div class='card-b'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605 <span>(2,143)</span></div><h3><a href='product.html'>Studio Deluxe 1/4\\\\u2033 Yoga Mat</a></h3><p class='mini'>Extra cushioning, non-slip, 24\\\\u2033 x 68\\\\u2033 \\\\u2022 12 colors</p><div class='mt'><div class='price'>$29.95<span class='was'>$39.95</span></div><span class='save'>You save $10.00</span><button class='btn btn-primary btn-full btn-sm' style='margin-top:10px' onclick='YD.add(\\\"Studio Deluxe 1/4\\\\u2033 Yoga Mat\\\",29.95,1)'>Add to cart</button></div></div></div><div class='card'><div class='thumb t2'><span class='flag green'>Eco pick</span>\\\\ud83c\\\\udf3f</div><div class='card-b'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605 <span>(876)</span></div><h3><a href='product.html'>EcoPro Natural Rubber Mat 5mm</a></h3><p class='mini'>Grippy, sweat-proof, zero PVC \\\\u2022 sustainably tapped rubber</p><div class='mt'><div class='price'>$69.95</div><span class='save'>Free shipping</span><button class='btn btn-primary btn-full btn-sm' style='margin-top:10px' onclick='YD.add(\\\"EcoPro Natural Rubber Mat 5mm\\\",69.95,1)'>Add to cart</button></div></div></div><div class='card'><div class='thumb t3'><span class='flag'>Studio favorite</span>\\\\ud83e\\\\uddf1</div><div class='card-b'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2606 <span>(1,504)</span></div><h3><a href='product.html'>Recycled Foam Yoga Block (Pair)</a></h3><p class='mini'>4\\\\u2033 x 6\\\\u2033 x 9\\\\u2033 \\\\u2022 high-density, won\\\\u2019t crumble</p><div class='mt'><div class='price'>$19.95<span class='was'>$24.95</span></div><span class='save'>Bulk price from $7.95/blk</span><button class='btn btn-primary btn-full btn-sm' style='margin-top:10px' onclick='YD.add(\\\"Recycled Foam Yoga Block (Pair)\\\",19.95,1)'>Add to cart</button></div></div></div><div class='card'><div class='thumb t4'>\\\\ud83e\\\\udea2</div><div class='card-b'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605 <span>(932)</span></div><h3><a href='product.html'>8ft Cotton Strap with D-Ring</a></h3><p class='mini'>Heavy cotton weave, teacher-approved</p><div class='mt'><div class='price'>$9.95</div><span class='save'>Add 3 to hit free shipping faster</span><button class='btn btn-primary btn-full btn-sm' style='margin-top:10px' onclick='YD.add(\\\"8ft Cotton Strap with D-Ring\\\",9.95,1)'>Add to cart</button></div></div></div></div><p style='margin-top:24px'><a class='btn btn-out' href='shop.html'>Shop all mats &amp; props &rsaquo;</a></p></div></section><section style='background:var(--sand)'><div class='wrap split'><div><div class='eyebrow'>Best value \\\\u2022 Save $24.90</div><h2>The Studio Starter Kit</h2><p class='sub'>Everything a new student or teacher needs in one box: Studio Deluxe mat, two foam blocks, and an 8ft cotton strap. Bought separately: $79.85.</p><ul class='ticks'><li>1 \\\\u00d7 Studio Deluxe 1/4\\\\u2033 mat (12 colors)</li><li>2 \\\\u00d7 Recycled foam blocks</li><li>1 \\\\u00d7 8ft cotton strap with D-ring</li><li>Qualifies for free shipping automatically</li></ul><div class='cta-row'><button class='btn btn-primary' onclick='YD.add(\\\"Studio Starter Kit (mat + 2 blocks + strap)\\\",54.95,1)'>Add