m' onsubmit='return ydLead(this)'><h3 style='margin:0 0 4px'>Get your custom price sheet</h3><p class='mini' style='margin:0 0 14px'>Free, no obligation. Replies within 1 business hour.</p><div class='two'><div class='field'><label for='n'>Name</label><input id='n' name='name' required placeholder='Jane Doe'></div><div class='field'><label for='b'>Studio / business</label><input id='b' name='biz' placeholder='Riverbend Yoga'></div></div><div class='two'><div class='field'><label for='e'>Work email</label><input id='e' type='email' name='email' required placeholder='you@studio.com'></div><div class='field'><label for='p'>Phone</label><input id='p' name='phone' placeholder='(555) 555-0199'></div></div><div class='field'><label for='q'>What do you need?</label><select id='q' name='need'><option>20\\\\u201350 mats for a studio</option><option>50\\\\u2013100 mats for an event</option><option>Blocks, straps &amp; bolsters in bulk</option><option>Full studio outfit (mats + props)</option><option>Custom logo printing</option><option>Something else</option></select></div><button class='btn btn-primary btn-full' type='submit'>Send me wholesale pricing</button><p class='mini' style='text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0'>\\\\ud83d\\\\udd12 We never share your details. Or call <a href='tel:18005550199'><strong>1-800-555-0199</strong></a>.</p></form></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><h2>18,400+ yogis and studio owners have our back</h2><p class='sub'>Verified reviews from real orders.</p><div class='quotes'><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div>We outfitted all 42 spots in our hot studio with the Studio Deluxe mats. Two years of daily classes and they are still holding up. The bulk price made it possible.<b>\\\\u2014 Marisa L., studio owner, Austin TX</b></div><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div>Ordered Friday, practicing on it Monday. The grip on the EcoPro is the best I have used, and it cost half what the boutique brands charge.<b>\\\\u2014 Devin R., verified buyer</b></div><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div>I emailed for a quote for 120 blocks for our school district and had pricing back the same morning. Easiest vendor I work with.<b>\\\\u2014 Karen P., PE coordinator</b></div></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap'><div class='story split'><div><h2>From our team of yoga lovers to you</h2><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more.</p><p>We manufacture and source our own goods, which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the yoga community as a whole. From our team of yoga lovers to you \\\\u2014 thank you.</p><p><a class='btn btn-out' href='about.html'>Read our story &rsaquo;</a></p></div><form class='form' onsubmit='return ydSub(this)'><h3 style='margin:0 0 4px'>Take 10% off your first order</h3><p class='mini' style='margin:0 0 14px'>Join 90,000+ subscribers for new arrivals, practice tips and members-only sales. One email a week, unsubscribe anytime.</p><div class='field'><label for='em'>Email address</label><input id='em' type='email' required placeholder='you@email.com'></div><button class='btn btn-primary btn-full' type='submit'>Email me my 10% code</button></form></div></div></section><section style='background:var(--sand)'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:820px'><h2>Questions, answered</h2><div class='faq'><details open><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p>In-stock orders placed before 1pm PT ship the same business day from our own warehouse; everything else goes out the next business day. Most US addresses receive delivery in 2\\\\u20135 business days.</p></details><details><summary>What does shipping cost?</summary><p>Free on US orders over $75. Under $75, flat-rate ground starts at $7.95. Pallet and freight quotes are free \\\\u2014 just ask.</p></details><details><summary>Can I return a mat I have already unrolled?</summary><p>Yes. You have 30 days to try it. If it is not right, contact us for a return label and a full refund or exchange.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer studio or bulk discounts?</summary><p>Always. Discounts start at 10 units and reach 35% plus free freight at 100+. <a href='wholesale.html'>Request a price sheet here.</a></p></details><details><summary>Can you print our studio logo on mats?</summary><p>Yes \\\\u2014 one-color and full-color printing on mats, straps and bags with a 50-unit minimum. Mention it on the wholesale form and we will send artwork specs.</p></details></div></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><a class='logo' href='index.html' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span><em style='color:#8fa09a'>Direct since 1999</em></a><p style='margin-top:12px'>One of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country \\\\u2014 supplying the yoga community since 1999.</p><p><strong style='color:#fff'>\\\\u260E 1-800-555-0199</strong><br>Mon\\\\u2013Fri, 9am\\\\u20135pm PT<br><a href='mailto:hello@yogadirect.com'>hello@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href='shop.html'>All yoga mats</a><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; wedges</a><a href='shop.html#props'>Straps &amp; belts</a><a href='shop.html#props'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a><a href='shop.html#kits'>Studio kits &amp; bundles</a></div><div><h4>Business</h4><a href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale pricing</a><a href='wholesale.html'>Bulk &amp; freight orders</a><a href='wholesale.html'>Custom logo printing</a><a href='wholesale.html'>Net-30 terms</a></div><div><h4>Help</h4><a href='support.html'>Shipping &amp; delivery</a><a href='support.html#returns'>Returns &amp; exchanges</a><a href='support.html#contact'>Contact us</a><a href='about.html'>About YogaDirect</a></div></div><div class='legal'><span>&copy; 1999\\\\u20132024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout \\\\u2022 Visa \\\\u2022 Mastercard \\\\u2022 Amex \\\\u2022 PayPal \\\\u2022 Purchase orders accepted</span></div></div></footer><div class='backdrop' onclick='YD.close()'></div><aside class='drawer' aria-label='Shopping cart'><div class='drawer-h'><strong>Your cart</strong><button class='linkb' onclick='YD.close()'>Close \\\\u2715</button></div><div class='drawer-b'><div id='shipMsg' class='mini'></div><div class='ship-bar'><i id='shipFill'></i></div><div id='cartItems'></div></div><div class='drawer-f'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px'><span>Subtotal</span><span id='cartTotal'>$0.00</span></div><a class='btn btn-primary btn-full' href='#'>Secure checkout</a><p class='mini' style='text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0'>\\\\ud83d\\\\udd12 Encrypted checkout \\\\u2022 30-day returns \\\\u2022 Ships in 1 business day</p></div></aside><script>function ydLead(f){f.innerHTML='<div style=text-align:center;padding:18px><h3>Thanks \\\\u2014 your price sheet is on the way</h3><p class=mini>A yoga specialist will email your custom wholesale pricing within 1 business hour (Mon\\\\u2013Fri, 9\\\\u20135 PT). Need it sooner? Call 1-800-555-0199.</p></div>';return false}function ydSub(f){f.innerHTML='<div style=text-align:center;padding:18px><h3>Check your inbox</h3><p class=mini>Your 10% welcome code is on its way. It works on everything, including sale items.</p></div>';return false}var YD={k:'yd_cart',get:function(){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(this.k))||[]}catch(e){return[]}},save:function(c){localStorage.setItem(this.k,JSON.stringify(c));this.dr