9.95</span></button></div><p class='mini' style='margin-top:-6px'>\\\\ud83d\\\\udfe2 In stock: 1,480 units \\\\u2022 Ships in 1 business day \\\\u2022 Free returns for 30 days</p><div class='upsell'><span style='font-size:30px'>\\\\ud83c\\\\udf81</span><div><b>Add 2 foam blocks + an 8ft strap for $25 (save $14.90)</b><span class='mini'>Most customers who buy this mat add props. Bundle now and you also clear the $75 free-shipping threshold.</span></div><button class='btn btn-out btn-sm' onclick='YD.add(\\\"Block + Strap Add-On Bundle\\\",25,1)'>Add bundle</button></div><ul class='ticks'><li>1/4\\\\u2033 (6mm) closed-cell foam \\\\u2014 extra joint cushioning</li><li>24\\\\u2033 x 68\\\\u2033 standard studio size, 2.6 lb</li><li>Non-slip textured top, latex-free, phthalate-free</li><li>Wipes clean in seconds \\\\u2014 built for daily class use</li><li>Backed by 25 years of studio-tested design</li></ul><p class='mini'>Questions before you buy? Call <a href='tel:18005550199'><strong>1-800-555-0199</strong></a> or email <a href='mailto:hello@yogadirect.com'>hello@yogadirect.com</a> \\\\u2014 real yogis answer.</p></div></div></div><section style='background:var(--sand)'><div class='wrap two'><div><h2>Specifications</h2><table class='spec'><tr><td>Thickness</td><td>1/4 inch (6mm)</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensions</td><td>24\\\\u2033 W x 68\\\\u2033 L</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>2.6 lb</td></tr><tr><td>Material</td><td>Closed-cell PVC foam, latex &amp; phthalate free</td></tr><tr><td>Surface</td><td>Lightly textured, non-slip both sides</td></tr><tr><td>Best for</td><td>Vinyasa, hatha, gentle, restorative, studio rentals</td></tr><tr><td>Care</td><td>Wipe with mild soap and water, air dry</td></tr><tr><td>Warranty</td><td>1 year against manufacturing defects</td></tr></table></div><div><h2>Shipping &amp; returns</h2><ul class='ticks'><li><strong>Free US shipping over $75</strong> \\\\u2014 flat $7.95 below that</li><li>Ships in 1 business day from our own warehouse</li><li>2\\\\u20135 business day delivery for most US addresses</li><li><strong>30-day free returns</strong>, even if you have unrolled it</li><li>Purchase orders and net-30 available for studios and schools</li></ul><h2 style='margin-top:24px'>Buying for a class?</h2><p class='sub'>Studio pricing starts at 10 mats. Tell us your quantity and we will send a price sheet within 1 business hour.</p><a class='btn btn-out' href='wholesale.html'>Get studio pricing &rsaquo;</a></div></div></section><section id='reviews'><div class='wrap'><h2>What 2,143 reviewers say</h2><p class='sub'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605 4.8 average \\\\u2022 96% would buy again \\\\u2022 Verified purchases only</p><div class='two'><div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div><b>Best value mat we have found in 11 years</b><p>We replaced 40 rental mats and the price per mat was less than half of what our old supplier charged. Grip is great even in a warm room.<span class='mini'> \\\\u2014 Marisa L., studio owner (verified)</span></p></div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div><b>My knees thank me</b><p>The quarter inch makes kneeling poses comfortable without feeling squishy in balance poses.<span class='mini'> \\\\u2014 Priya S. (verified)</span></p></div></div><div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div><b>Fast, easy, no drama</b><p>Ordered two on a Thursday, they arrived Monday, and one color was not what I expected \\\\u2014 the return label was emailed in 10 minutes.<span class='mini'> \\\\u2014 Tom W. (verified)</span></p></div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2606</div><b>Great mat, slight smell at first</b><p>Aired it out for a day and it was fine. Two months of daily practice and no flaking or thin spots.<span class='mini'> \\\\u2014 Andrea K. (verified)</span></p></div></div></div></div></section