id='cartCount' class='pill'>0</span></button></div><button class='menu-btn' onclick='document.body.classList.toggle(\\\"nav-open\\\")'>\\\\u2630</button></div></header><div class='hero'><div class='wrap hero-grid'><div><div class='eyebrow'>Wholesale &amp; bulk \\\\u2022 12,000+ studios served</div><h1>Outfit your studio for 15\\\\u201335% less</h1><p class='lead'>We manufacture and source our own mats and props, so studios, gyms, schools, hotels and event planners buy direct \\\\u2014 with a dedicated account rep, net-30 terms and free freight on pallet orders.</p><ul class='ticks'><li>Tiered discounts starting at just 10 units</li><li>Free freight on orders of 100+ units</li><li>Net-30 terms and purchase orders accepted</li><li>Custom logo printing from 50 units</li><li>Standing reorder schedules so you never run out</li><li>Same-day drop-shipping to event venues</li></ul><div class='logos' style='justify-content:flex-start;margin-top:22px'><span>RIVERBEND YOGA</span><span>CORE COLLECTIVE</span><span>MESA SCHOOL DISTRICT</span><span>HOTEL SERENA</span></div></div><form class='form' onsubmit='return ydLead(this)'><h2 style='margin:0 0 4px'>Get your free price sheet</h2><p class='mini' style='margin:0 0 16px'>No account setup, no obligation. A real specialist replies within 1 business hour (Mon\\\\u2013Fri, 9\\\\u20135 PT).</p><div class='two'><div class='field'><label for='n'>Name*</label><input id='n' required placeholder='Jane Doe'></div><div class='field'><label for='b'>Studio / organization</label><input id='b' placeholder='Riverbend Yoga'></div></div><div class='two'><div class='field'><label for='e'>Work email*</label><input id='e' type='email' required placeholder='you@studio.com'></div><div class='field'><label for='p'>Phone</label><input id='p' placeholder='(555) 555-0199'></div></div><div class='two'><div class='field'><label for='t'>Type of buyer</label><select id='t'><option>Yoga studio</option><option>Gym / fitness center</option><option>School / university</option><option>Corporate wellness</option><option>Hotel / spa / retreat</option><option>Event or festival</option><option>Reseller / retailer</option></select></div><div class='field'><label for='q'>Estimated quantity</label><select id='q'><option>10\\\\u201324 units</option><option>25\\\\u201399 units</option><option>100\\\\u2013499 units</option><option>500+ units / pallets</option></select></div></div><div class='field'><label for='m'>What do you need? (optional)</label><textarea id='m' rows='3' placeholder='40 mats, 80 blocks, 40 straps \\\\u2014 needed by March 1. Interested in logo printing.'></textarea></div><button class='btn btn-primary btn-full' type='submit'>Send my wholesale quote</button><p class='mini' style='text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0'>\\\\ud83d\\\\udd12 Your info stays with our wholesale desk. Prefer to talk? <a href='tel:18005550199'><strong>1-800-555-0199</strong></a></p></form></div></div><section><div class='wrap'><h2>Volume pricing at a glance</h2><p class='sub'>Example pricing on our best-selling Studio Deluxe 1/4\\\\u2033 mat. Props, bolsters and blankets follow the same tier structure \\\\u2014 mix and match products to reach a tier.</p><table class='tiers'><tr><th>Order size</th><th>Discount</th><th>Price per mat</th><th>Freight</th><th>Terms</th></tr><tr><td>10\\\\u201324 units</td><td>15% off</td><td>$25.45</td><td>Free ground</td><td>Card / PayPal</td></tr><tr><td>25\\\\u201399 units</td><td>25% off</td><td>$22.45</td><td>Free ground</td><td>Net-30 on approval</td></tr><tr><td>100\\\\u2013499 units</td><td>35% off</td><td>$19.45</td><td>Free freight</td><td>Net-30 + PO</td></tr><tr><td>500+ / pallets</td><td>Custom quote</td><td>Ask us</td><td>Free freight</td><td>Net-30 + PO</td></tr></table><p class='mini' style='margin-top:12px'>Pricing shown is illustrative; your rep will confirm exact pricing and lead times in your quote.</p></div></section><section style='background:var(--sand)'><div class='wrap'><h2>Why studios keep reordering from us</h2><p class='sub'>Since 1999 we have shipped more than 2 million mats and props. Here is what that means for your budget and your students.</p><div class='grid3'><div class='box'><i>\\\\ud83c\\\\udfed</i><h3>Manufacturer-direct</h3><p class='mini' style='font-size:14.5px'>We make and source our own goods, so there is no distributor markup between our warehouse and your studio floor.</p></div><div class='box'><i>\\\\u23f1\\\\ufe0f</i><h3>Fast, predictable supply</h3><p class='mini' style='font-size:14.5px'>Deep inventory and 1-business-day dispatch. Set a standing reorder and we ship on schedule automatically.</p></div><div class='box'><i>\\\\ud83d\\\\udee1\\\\ufe0f</i><h3>Studio-tested durability</h3><p class='mini' style='font-size:14.5px'>Our mats are built for rental racks and daily classes \\\\u2014 not just one gentle home practice a week.</p></div><div class='box'><i>\\\\ud83c\\\\udfa8</i><h3>Custom branding</h3><p class='mini' style='font-size:14.5px'>Print your logo on mats, straps and bags from 50 units. Great for retail resale and teacher-training kits.</p></div><div class='box'><i>\\\\ud83e\\\\uddfe</i><h3>Easy procurement</h3><p class='mini' style='font-size:14.5px'>Purchase orders, W-9s, net-30 terms and itemized quotes for schools, universities and municipalities.</p></div><div class='box'><i>\\\\ud83e\\\\udd1d</i><h3>One rep who knows you</h3><p class='mini' style='font-size:14.5px'>A named account contact who remembers your colors, quantities and delivery dock hours.</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><h2>Wholesale customers on the record</h2><div class='grid3' style='margin-top:20px'><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div>We outfitted 42 spots with Studio Deluxe mats and cut our mat budget by about 40% versus our old distributor. Two years on, they are still in rotation.<b>\\\\u2014 Marisa L., owner, Riverbend Yoga (Austin, TX)</b></div><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div>I needed 120 blocks with a PO and a hard delivery date. Quote in the morning, pallet on the dock in five days.<b>\\\\u2014 Karen P., PE coordinator, public school district</b></div><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div>They drop-shipped 300 logo-printed mats straight to our festival site. Our attendees took them home and we sold out of extras.<b>\\\\u2014 Devin R., event producer</b></div></div></div></section><section style='background:var(--sand)'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:840px'><h2>Wholesale FAQ</h2><div class='faq'><details open><summary>Is there a minimum order?</summary><p>Discount tiers begin at 10 units, and you can mix products to reach a tier. There is no minimum to order at retail prices.</p></details><details><summary>How fast will I get a quote?</summary><p>Within 1 business hour, Monday to Friday, 9\\\\u20135 PT. Urgent event deadline? Call 1-800-555-0199 and we will price it live.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer net-30 or accept purchase orders?</summary><p>Yes. Net-30 is available on approval for studios, schools, government and corporate accounts, and we accept POs with itemized quotes and W-9 documentation.</p></details><details><summary>Can you print our logo?</summary><p>Yes \\\\u2014 one-color and full-color printing on mats, straps and bags from 50 units. We will send artwork specs and a digital proof before production.</p></details><details><summary>What about freight and lead times?</summary><p>In-stock bulk orders dispatch in 1\\\\u20132 business days; LTL freight typically delivers in 3\\\\u20137 business days. Free freight on 100+ units. Custom printed goods run 2\\\\u20133 weeks.</p></details><details><summary>Can you drop-ship to an event venue?</summary><p>Absolutely. Give us the venue address, dock hours and contact and we will coordinate delivery windows.</p></details></div></div></section><section class='band'><div class='wrap'><h2>Ready to see your number?</h2><p class='sub'>Tell us the quantity and we will send your custom price sheet within the hour \\\\u2014 free, with no obligation.</p><a class='btn btn-primary' href='#top' onclick='window.scrollTo(0,0)'>Get my wholesale quote</a> <a class='btn btn-out' href='tel:18005550199' style='background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:#fff'>\\\\u260E Call 1-800-555-0199</a></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><a class='logo' href='index.html' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span><em style='color:#8fa09a'>Direct since 1999</em></a><p style='margin-top:12px'>One of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country \\\\u2014 supplying the yoga community since 1999.</p><p><strong style='color:#fff'>\\\\u260E 1-800-555-0199</strong><br>Mon\\\\u2013Fri, 9am\\\\u20135pm PT<br><a href='mailto:wholesale@yogadirect.com'>wholesale@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href='shop.html'>All yoga mats</a><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; wedges</a><a href='shop.html#props'>Straps &amp; belts</a><a href='shop.html#props'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a><a href='shop.html#kits'>Studio kits &amp; bundles</a></div><div><h4>Business</h4><a href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale pricing</a><a href='wholesale.html'>Bulk &amp; freight orders</a><a href='wholesale.html'>Custom logo printing</a><a href='wholesale.html'>Net-30 terms</a></div><div><h4>Help</h4><a href='support.html'>Shipping &amp; delivery</a><a href='support.html#returns'>Returns &amp; exchanges</a><a href='support.html#contact'>Contact us</a><a href='about.html'>About YogaDirect</a></div></div><div class='legal'><span>&copy; 1999\\\\u20132024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout \\\\u2022 Visa \\\\u2022 Mastercard \\\\u2022 Amex \\\\u2022 PayPal \\\\u2022 Purchase orders accepted</span></div></div></footer><div class='backdrop' onclick='YD.close()'></div><aside class='drawer' aria-label='Shopping cart'><div class='drawer-h'><strong>Your cart</strong><button class='linkb' onclick='YD.close()'>Close \\\\u2715</button></div><div class='drawer-b'><div id='shipMsg' class='mini'></div><div class='ship-bar'><i id='shipFill'></i></div><div id='cartItems'></div></div><div class='drawer-f'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px'><span>Subtotal</span><span id='cartTotal'>$0.00</span></div><a class='btn btn-primary btn-full' href='#'>Secure checkout</a><p class='mini' style='text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0'>\\\\ud83d\\\\udd12 Encrypted checkout \\\\u2022 30-day returns \\\\u2022 Ships in 1 business day</p></div></aside><script>function ydLead(f){f.innerHTML='<div style=text-align:center;padding:22px><h2>Thanks \\\\u2014 your price sheet is on the way</h2><p class=mini>A wholesale specialist will email your custom pricing within 1 business hour (Mon\\\\u2013Fri, 9\\\\u20135 PT). Need it faster? Call 1-800-555-0199 and mention your quote request.</p></div>';return false}var YD={k:'yd_cart',get:function(){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(this.k))||[]}catch(e){return[]}},save:function(c){localStorage.setItem(this.k,JSON.stringify(c));this.draw()},add:function(n,p,q){q=parseInt(q||1)||1;var c=this.get(),i=-1;c.forEach(function(x,j){if(x.n===n)i=j});if(i>-1){c[i].q+=q}else{c.push({n:n,p:p,q:q})}this.save(c);this.open()},rm:function(i){var c=this.get();c.splice(i,1);this.save(c)},total:function(){return this.get().reduce(function(s,x){return s+x.p*x.q},0)},open:function(){document.body.classList.add('cart-open')},close:function(){document.body.classList.remove('cart-open')},draw:function(){var c=this.get(),t=this.total(),n=c.reduce(function(s,x){return s+x.q},0);Array.prototype.forEach.call(document.querySelectorAll('#cartCount'),function(e){e.textContent=n});var b=document.getElementById('cartItems');if(b){b.innerHTML=c.length?c.map(function(x,i){return '<div class=ci><b>'+x.n+' <span class=mini>x'+x.q+'</span></b><span>$'+(x.p*x.q).toFixed(2)+'</span><button class=linkb onclick=YD.rm('+i+')>remove</button></div>'}).join(''):'<p class=mini>Your cart is empty. <a href=shop.html>Shop best sellers</a></p>'}var tt=document.getElementById('cartTotal');if(tt)tt.textContent='$'+t.toFixed(2);var m=document.getElementById('shipMsg');var left=75-t;if(m)m.innerHTML=t===0?'Spend $75 to unlock <b>free shipping</b>':(left>0?'You are <b>$'+left.toFixed(2)+'</b> away from FREE shipping':'\\\\ud83c\\\\udf89 You have unlocked <b>FREE shipping</b>');var f=document.getElementById('shipFill');if(f)f.style.width=Math.min(100,t/75*100)+'%'}};document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){YD.draw()});</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/about.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>About YogaDirect \\\\u2014 Supplying the Yoga Community Since 1999</title><meta name='description' content='YogaDirect has supplied yoga mats and props since 1999. We manufacture and source our own goods so we can offer high-quality gear at amazing prices for studios and home practice.'><style>:root{--ink:#14241f;--teal:#1d4f47;--teal2:#2a6b60;--sand:#f8f4ec;--line:#e7e1d6;--acc:#c9552d;--acch:#a8421f;--mut:#5e6c67}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;background:#fff}a{color:inherit}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.narrow{max-width:760px}.announce{background:var(--teal);color:#fff;font-size:13px}.announce-in{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:9px 0;flex-wrap:wrap;text-align:center}.announce a{color:#ffd9a8;font-weight:700}.dot{opacity:.5}header.site{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:12px 20px;position