mary' href='shop.html'>Shop best sellers</a> <a class='btn btn-out' href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale pricing</a></p></div></section><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap'><div class='stats'><div><b>1999</b><span>Year we started</span></div><div><b>2M+</b><span>Mats &amp; props shipped</span></div><div><b>12,000+</b><span>Studios &amp; gyms supplied</span></div><div><b>4.8/5</b><span>Average customer rating</span></div></div><div class='split'><div><h2>Why we can charge less</h2><p>We manufacture and source our own goods, which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. There is no distributor in the middle adding a markup between our factory partners and your practice.</p><p>We are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more \\\\u2014 from a single mat for a beginner to a pallet of gear for a 60-spot hot studio.</p><p>When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the yoga community as a whole. From our team of yoga lovers to you \\\\u2014 thank you.</p><p><a class='btn btn-out' href='shop.html'>See what we make &rsaquo;</a></p></div><div class='art'>Owned inventory \\\\u2022 Our own warehouse \\\\u2022 Direct pricing since 1999</div></div></div></section><section style='background:var(--sand)'><div class='wrap'><h2>What we promise every customer</h2><div class='grid3' style='margin-top:22px'><div class='box'><i>\\\\ud83c\\\\udff7\\\\ufe0f</i><h3>Honest, direct pricing</h3><p>Manufacturer-direct means studio-quality gear at prices that work for teachers, students and school budgets.</p></div><div class='box'><i>\\\\ud83d\\\\ude9a</i><h3>Ships in 1 business day</h3><p>We stock deep and pick fast from our own warehouse. Free US shipping on orders over $75.</p></div><div class='box'><i>\\\\u21a9\\\\ufe0f</i><h3>30-day no-hassle returns</h3><p>Unroll it. Practice on it. If it is not right, we will take it back within 30 days, no interrogation.</p></div><div class='box'><i>\\\\u260e\\\\ufe0f</i><h3>Real humans on the phone</h3><p>Call 1-800-555-0199 and speak with someone who actually practices and knows the products.</p></div><div class='box'><i>\\\\ud83c\\\\udf3f</i><h3>Better materials over time</h3><p>Growing eco range: natural rubber, cork, recycled foam and organic cotton props.</p></div><div class='box'><i>\\\\ud83e\\\\udd1d</i><h3>Community first</h3><p>We support teacher trainings, school programs and community classes with donated and discounted gear.</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap narrow'><h2>25 years, one mat at a time</h2><div class='tl'><div><b>1999</b>YogaDirect opens with a small catalog of mats and straps and a simple promise: direct prices for the yoga community.</div><div><b>2004</b>We begin manufacturing and sourcing our own goods, cutting out distributor markups for good.</div><div><b>2011</b>Our wholesale desk launches to serve studios, gyms and schools with tiered volume pricing and net-30 terms.</div><div><b>2017</b>Eco line arrives \\\\u2014 natural rubber mats, cork props and recycled foam blocks.</div><div><b>Today</b>One of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country, with 12,000+ studio customers and more than 2 million mats and props shipped.</div></div></div></section><section class='band'><div class='wrap narrow'><h2>Ready to roll out something new?</h2><p>Shop manufacturer-direct prices, or ask our wholesale desk for a studio price sheet \\\\u2014 answered within 1 business hour.</p><p><a class='btn btn-primary' href='shop.html'>Shop yoga gear</a> <a class='btn btn-out' href='wholesale.html' style='background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:#fff'>Get wholesale pricing</a></p></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><a class='logo' href='index.html' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span><em style='color:#8fa09a'>Direct since 1999</em></a><p style='margin-top:12px'>One of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country \\\\u2014 supplying the yoga community since 1999.</p><p><strong style='color:#fff'>\\\\u260E 1-800-555-0199</strong><br>Mon\\\\u2013Fri, 9am\\\\u20135pm PT<br><a href='mailto:hello@yogadirect.com'>hello@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href='shop.html'>All yoga mats</a><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; wedges</a><a href='shop.html#props'>Straps &amp; belts</a><a href='shop.html#props'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a><a href='shop.html#kits'>Studio kits &amp; bundles</a></div><div><h4>Business</h4><a href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale pricing</a><a href='wholesale.html'>Bulk &amp; freight orders</a><a href='wholesale.html'>Custom logo printing</a><a href='wholesale.html'>Net-30 terms</a></div><div><h4>Help</h4><a href='support.html'>Shipping &amp; delivery</a><a href='support.html#returns'>Returns &amp; exchanges</a><a href='support.html#contact'>Contact us</a><a href='about.html'>About YogaDirect</a></div></div><div class='legal'><span>&copy; 1999\\\\u20132024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout \\\\u2022 Visa \\\\u2022 Mastercard \\\\u2022 Amex \\\\u2022 PayPal \\\\u2022 Purchase orders accepted</span></div></div></footer><div class='backdrop' onclick='YD.close()'></div><aside class='drawer' aria-label='Shopping cart'><div class='drawer-h'><strong>Your cart</strong><button class='linkb' onclick='YD.close()'>Close \\\\u2715</button></div><div class='drawer-b'><div id='shipMsg' class='mini'></div><div class='ship-bar'><i id='shipFill'></i></div><div id='cartItems'></div></div><div class='drawer-f'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px'><span>Subtotal</span><span id='cartTotal'>$0.00</span></div><a class='btn btn-primary btn-full' href='#'>Secure checkout</a><p class='mini' style='text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0'>\\\\ud83d\\\\udd12 Encrypted checkout \\\\u2022 30-day returns \\\\u2022 Sh