hree years of hot classes.</p><b>Dana R. &mdash; Studio owner, Austin TX</b></div><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p style='margin:8px 0'>Ordered Friday, practicing on it Monday. The 1/4 inch mat is genuinely cushier than the boutique brand I paid triple for.</p><b>Marcus L. &mdash; Home practitioner</b></div><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p style='margin:8px 0'>Our school district ordered 120 blocks and straps. The quote came back the same morning and the freight was free.</p><b>Priya S. &mdash; PE coordinator</b></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap email'><div><h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2><p class='muted' style='margin:10px 0 0'>Join 40,000 yogis who get first access to closeout deals, new props and studio-only offers. One email a week, unsubscribe anytime.</p></div><form onsubmit='this.innerHTML=&quot;<h3>Check your inbox &#127881; Your code WELCOME10 is on its way.</h3>&quot;;return false'><label for='e1'>Email address</label><input id='e1' type='email' required placeholder='you@example.com'><button class='btn full' style='margin-top:12px'>Send my 10% code</button><p class='muted' style='font-size:12px;margin-top:8px'>Code applies to your first order. No spam, ever.</p></form></div></section><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap box'><h2>About YogaDirect</h2><p class='muted' style='margin-top:12px'>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p><p style='margin-top:16px'><a class='btn sm alt' href='/about'>Read our story</a> <a class='btn sm ghost' href='/contact'>Talk to a human</a></p></div></section><footer class='ft'><div class='wrap fgrid'><div><a class='logo' href='/' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#8fc7a6'>Direct</span></a><p style='margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;color:#c6d8cc;max-width:290px'>Manufacturing and supplying yoga mats and props to studios, schools, therapists and home practitioners since 1999.</p><p style='margin-top:14px;font-size:15px'><b>1-800-555-YOGA</b><br><span style='color:#9db3a5;font-size:13px'>Mon&ndash;Fri 8am&ndash;5pm PT</span></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href='/shop'>All products</a><a href='/products/deluxe-yoga-mat'>Yoga mats</a><a href='/shop'>Blocks &amp; straps</a><a href='/shop'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a><a href='/studio-kits'>Studio kits</a></div><div><h4>Buy in bulk</h4><a href='/wholesale'>Wholesale pricing</a><a href='/wholesale'>Request a quote</a><a href='/studio-kits'>Studio &amp; school kits</a><a href='/contact'>Events &amp; retreats</a></div><div><h4>Help</h4><a href='/faq'>Shipping &amp; returns</a><a href='/faq'>FAQ</a><a href='/contact'>Contact us</a><a href='/about'>About YogaDirect</a></div></div><div class='wrap'><div class='fbot'>&copy; 1999&ndash;2024 YogaDirect. Free shipping over $75 &middot; 30-day returns &middot; Secure 256-bit checkout &middot; Visa &middot; Mastercard &middot; Amex &middot; PayPal &middot; Purchase orders welcome</div></div></footer><div id='ov' onclick='closeCart()'></div><aside id='drw'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'><h3>Your cart</h3><button onclick='closeCart()' style='border:0;background:none;font-size:26px;cursor:pointer'>&times;</button></div><div class='pbar'><i id='shipFill'></i></div><p id='shipMsg' class='muted' style='font-size:13px'></p><div id='cartItems' style='margin:14px 0'></div><p style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:800;font-size:18px'>Total <span id='cartTotal'>$0.00</span></p><a class='btn full' href='/checkout' style='margin-top:12px'>Secure checkout</a><a class='btn ghost full' href='/shop' style='margin-top:8px'>Keep shopping</a><p class='muted' style='font-size:12px;margin-top:12px'>30-day returns &middot; Ships in 1 business day &middot; Secure 256-bit checkout</p></aside><script>function cartGet(){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('yd_cart')||'[]')}catch(e){return[]}}function cartSet(c){localStorage.setItem('yd_cart',JSON.stringify(c));cartRender()}function addToCart(n,p,q){q=q||1;var c=cartGet(),f=null;c.forEach(function(i){if(i.n===n)f=i});if(f){f.q+=q}else{c.push({n:n,p:p,q:q})}cartSet(c);openCart()}function rm(i){var c=cartGet();c.splice(i,1);cartSet(c)}function openCart(){document.getElementById('drw').classList.add('on');document.getElementById('ov').classList.add('on')}function closeCart(){document.getElementById('drw').classList.remove('on');document.getElementById('ov').classList.remove('on')}function cartRender(){var c=cartGet(),n=0,t=0;c.forEach(function(i){n+=i.q;t+=i.p*i.q});var cc=document.getElementById('cartCount');if(cc)cc.textContent=n;var b=document.getElementById('cartItems');if(!b)return;b.innerHTML=c.length?c.map(function(i,x){return '<div class=ci><span>'+i.q+' x '+i.n+'</span><b>$'+(i.p*i.q).toFixed(2)+'</b><button onclick=rm('+x+')>&times;</button></div>'}).join(''):'<p class=muted>Your cart is empty. Add a best seller to unlock free shipping over $75.</p>';document.getElementById('cartTotal').textContent='$'+t.toFixed(2);var left=75-t;document.getElementById('shipMsg').innerHTML=t>=75?'&#127881; You have unlocked FREE shipping!':'Add <b>$'+(left>0?left.toFixed(2):'0.00')+'</b> more for FREE shipping';document.getElementById('shipFill').style.width=Math.min(100,t/75*100)+'%'}document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',cartRender);</script></body></html>