ell top wipes clean in seconds &mdash; ideal for shared studio use</li><li>Made and stocked in the USA, ships in 1 business day</li><li>Need 10, 50 or 200? <a href='/wholesale'><b>Get volume pricing &rarr;</b></a></li></ul><div class='box' style='background:var(--sand)'><b>Frequently bought together</b><p class='muted' style='font-size:14px;margin:6px 0 12px'>Add the full set and unlock free shipping instantly.</p><button class='btn sm alt full' onclick='addToCart(&quot;Foam Yoga Blocks 2-pack&quot;,17.95)'>+ Add Foam Blocks 2-pack &mdash; $17.95</button><button class='btn sm ghost full' style='margin-top:8px' onclick='addToCart(&quot;Cotton Yoga Strap 8ft&quot;,9.95)'>+ Add Cotton Strap 8 ft &mdash; $9.95</button><button class='btn sm ghost full' style='margin-top:8px' onclick='addToCart(&quot;Mat Cleaner Spray 8oz&quot;,11.95)'>+ Add Mat Cleaner Spray &mdash; $11.95</button></div></div></div></div></section><section style='background:var(--sand)'><div class='wrap cols3'><div class='box'><h3>Specifications</h3><table style='margin-top:10px'><tr><th>Size</th><td>24 x 68 in.</td></tr><tr><th>Thickness</th><td>1/4 in. / 6 mm</td></tr><tr><th>Weight</th><td>3 lb</td></tr><tr><th>Material</th><td>6P-free PVC foam, closed cell</td></tr><tr><th>Care</th><td>Wipe clean, air dry</td></tr><tr><th>Warranty</th><td>1 year against defects</td></tr></table></div><div class='box'><h3>Customer reviews (4.8)</h3><p class='stars' style='margin-top:8px'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p><p style='font-size:15px'>Thicker than my $90 boutique mat and it does not slide on hardwood. Bought four for my teacher training.</p><p class='muted' style='font-size:13px'>&mdash; Renee K., verified buyer</p><hr style='border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:14px 0'><p class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p><p style='font-size:15px'>Two years of daily use, still flat and grippy. Reordered six for the studio.</p><p class='muted' style='font-size:13px'>&mdash; Tom H., studio owner</p></div><div class='box'><h3>Common questions</h3><details style='margin-top:10px'><summary>How fast will it arrive?</summary><p class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>In-stock orders leave our warehouse in 1 business day. Most US addresses receive delivery in 2&ndash;5 business days.</p></details><details><summary>What if I do not like it?</summary><p class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>Return it within 30 days for a full refund. No restocking fee.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer studio discounts?</summary><p class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>Yes &mdash; 10% off at 6 units, 20% at 12, up to 35% at 50+. <a href='/wholesale'>Request a quote</a>.</p></details><details><summary>Is it good for hot yoga?</summary><p class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>Yes. The textured closed-cell surface stays grippy when damp and wipes dry between classes.</p></details></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><h2>Complete your practice</h2><div class='prods' style='margin-top:22px'><div class='card'><div class='ph g3'>&#129704;</div><div class='body'><h3>Foam Yoga Blocks (2-pack)</h3><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.9</span><div class='push'><div style='font-weight:800'>$17.95</div><button class='btn sm full alt' style='margin-top:8px' onclick='addToCart(&quot;Foam Yoga Blocks 2-pack&quot;,17.95)'>Add</button></div></div></div><div class='card'><div class='ph g2'>&#128719;</div><div class='body'><h3>Round Cotton Bolster</h3><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.9</span><div class='push'><div style='font-weight:800'>$44.95</div><button class='btn sm full alt' style='margin-top:8px' onclick='addToCart(&quot;Round Cotton Bolster&quot;,44.95)'>Add</button></div></div></div><div class='card'><div class='ph g1'>&#129507;</div><div class='body'><h3>Yoga Blanket</h3><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.8</span><div class='push'><div style='font-weight:800'>$22.95</div><button class='btn sm full al