l#props'>Foam Yoga Blocks (2-pack)</a></h3><p>High-density, non-slip, 9&quot;x6&quot;x4&quot;</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$17.95</span><span class='was'>$24.00</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Foam Yoga Blocks 2-pack' data-price='17.95'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2b4f42,#7fa392)'><span class='chip'>Save 35%</span><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 5.0 (214)</div><h3><a href='shop.html#packs'>Studio Starter Pack (10 sets)</a></h3><p>10 mats + 10 blocks + 10 straps</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$399</span><span class='was'>$614</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Studio Starter Pack (10 sets)' data-price='399'>Add to cart</button></div></div></div><div class='center' style='margin-top:26px'><a class='btn btn-s' href='shop.html'>Shop all products</a></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap grid2'><div><div class='eyebrow'>Wholesale &amp; bulk</div><h2>Buying for a studio, school, gym or event?</h2><p class='sub'>Tell us what you need and we&rsquo;ll send a same-day quote with tiered pricing, freight options and lead times. No account fees, no annual minimums &mdash; discounts start at 10 units.</p><ul class='tick'><li>Dedicated rep who knows your reorder history</li><li>Free sample mat for qualifying studios</li><li>Net-30 terms available after your first order</li><li>Custom colors and logo printing on 100+ units</li></ul><div class='ctas' style='margin-top:24px'><a class='btn btn-p' href='wholesale.html'>Get my wholesale quote</a><a class='btn btn-s' href='contact.html'>Ask a question</a></div></div><div class='bulkbox'><h3 style='margin:0 0 6px;font-size:20px'>Volume pricing at a glance</h3><p style='margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px'>Applies automatically at checkout or on your quote.</p><table class='tiers'><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Discount</th><th>Shipping</th></tr><tr><td>10&ndash;24 units</td><td><strong>15% off</strong></td><td>Free</td></tr><tr><td>25&ndash;49 units</td><td><strong>25% off</strong></td><td>Free</td></tr><tr><td>50&ndash;99 units</td><td><strong>32% off</strong></td><td>Free</td></tr><tr><td>100+ units</td><td><strong>Up to 40% off</strong></td><td>Free freight</td></tr></table><p style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:14px 0 0'>Quotes returned within 1 business hour, 9am&ndash;5pm ET.</p></div></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><div class='center'><h2>Why practitioners and studio owners buy direct</h2><p class='sub'>Same factories, better prices, and people who actually practice yoga answering the phone.</p></div><div class='grid4'><div class='card' style='padding:22px'><h3>Made or sourced by us</h3><p>We own the specs and the supply chain, so quality stays consistent order after order.</p></div><div class='card' style='padding:22px'><h3>Priced for volume</h3><p>Outfit a full room for what one boutique mat costs elsewhere &mdash; without cutting corners.</p></div><div class='card' style='padding:22px'><h3>In stock &amp; ready</h3><p>Deep U.S. inventory means your class packs arrive before your next teacher training.</p></div><div class='card' style='padding:22px'><h3>Risk-free trial</h3><p>30 days to test on the mat. If it is not right, we make it right &mdash; fast.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><div class='center'><h2>What our customers say</h2><p class='sub'>Over 12,000 reviews from home practitioners, teachers and studio owners.</p></div><div class='grid3'><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p>&ldquo;We replaced 40 mats for our hot classes and saved nearly $1,100 versus our old supplier. Grip has held up through a full year of daily use.&rdquo;</p><div class='who'>Marisol R. <span>&middot; Studio owner, Austin TX</span></div></div><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p>&ldquo;Ordered Friday, blocks and straps landed Monday for our teacher training. The rep even confirmed quantities before shipping.&rdquo;</p><div class='who'>Dean P. <span>&middot; Program director, YMCA</span></div></div><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p>&ldquo;I have bought three mats here over the years. Honest pricing and it still beats the trendy brands on comfort.&rdquo;</p><div class='who'>Aisha K. <span>&middot; Home practitioner</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><div class='mail'><div><h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2><p>Join 90,000+ practitioners for restocks, new colors and studio-only deals. One email a week, unsubscribe anytime.</p></div><form class='mailform' data-mail><input type='email' required placeholder='you@email.com' aria-label='Email address'><button class='btn btn-p' type='submit'>Send my 10% code</button></form></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:820px'><div class='center'><h2>Questions, answered</h2></div><details class='faq' open><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p>Orders placed by 2pm ET ship the same business day from our U.S. warehouse. Most deliveries arrive in 2&ndash;5 business days; bulk freight orders are typically 3&ndash;7 business days.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p>30 days, no drama. If gear is not right for your practice, contact us for a return label. Unopened bulk orders can be returned within 30 days of delivery.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Do I need a business license for wholesale pricing?</summary><p>No license required. Volume discounts apply automatically at 10+ units. Studios, schools, gyms and non-profits can also request a custom quote with net-30 terms.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Can you print our studio logo on mats?</summary><p>Yes &mdash; logo printing and custom colors are available on orders of 100+ units, with proofs sent before production.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Are your mats latex-free and phthalate-free?</summary><p>Our Pro-Grip and Classic mats are latex-free and tested to be free of the six regulated phthalates. Full material specs are on each product page.</p></details><div class='center' style='margin-top:26px'><a class='btn btn-p' href='shop.html'>Start shopping</a></div></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fcols'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#8fb3a3'>Direct</span></div><p>Supplying yoga mats and props to studios, schools and home practitioners since 1999.</p><p><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a><br>Studio team replies within 1 business hour, 9am&ndash;5pm ET.</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='shop.html'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; props</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#packs'>Studio packs</a></li><li><a href='product-pro-grip-mat.html'>Pro-Grip mat</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Buy in bulk</h4><ul><li><a href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale pricing</a></li><li><a href='wholesale.html#form'>Request a quote</a></li><li><a href='wholesale.html#custom'>Custom logo mats</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='contact.html'>Contact us</a></li><li><a href='index.html#bestsellers'>Best sellers</a></li><li><a href='about.html'>Our story</a></li><li><a href='contact.html#shipping'>Shipping &amp; returns</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'><span>&copy; 1999&ndash;2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout &middot; Visa &middot; Mastercard &middot; Amex &middot; PayPal &middot; Purchase orders accepted</span></div></div></footer><div class='drawer' id='drawer'><div class='dback' data-close></div><div class='dpanel'><div class='dhead'><str