/8&quot; for travel.</p><div class='grid4'><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3f6f5c,#a8c6b8)'><span class='chip'>#1 best seller</span><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.8 (2,415)</div><h3><a href='product-pro-grip-mat.html'>Pro-Grip Yoga Mat &mdash; 5mm</a></h3><p>Sweat-proof grip for hot classes</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$59.95</span><span class='was'>$79.95</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Pro-Grip Yoga Mat 5mm' data-price='59.95'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5c7f9a,#cdd8e4)'><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.7 (3,902)</div><h3>Classic Yoga Mat &mdash; 1/4&quot;</h3><p>The studio workhorse, 12 colors</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$24.95</span><span class='was'>$32.00</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Classic Yoga Mat 1/4in' data-price='24.95'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6f8a5c,#d6e2c6)'><span class='chip'>Eco</span><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734; 4.6 (742)</div><h3>Natural Jute Blend Mat</h3><p>Plant fiber surface, biodegradable</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$44.95</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Natural Jute Blend Mat' data-price='44.95'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8a6f96,#ddd0e4)'><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.8 (611)</div><h3>XL Extra-Thick Mat &mdash; 8mm</h3><p>72&quot;x30&quot; joint-friendly cushion</p><div class='prow'><div><span class=