ss='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734; 4.6 (1,022)</div><h3>Mexican-Style Yoga Blanket</h3><p>Heavyweight, machine washable</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$22.95</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Mexican-Style Yoga Blanket' data-price='22.95'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5f7d6f,#c9dbd0)'><span class='chip'>Eco</span><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.9 (376)</div><h3>Cork Yoga Block</h3><p>Sustainable, sweat resistant</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$16.95</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Cork Yoga Block' data-price='16.95'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8f7d5c,#e2d8c2)'><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.7 (289)</div><h3>Grip Mat Towel</h3><p>Silicone dots, hot-class ready</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$27.95</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Grip Mat Towel' data-price='27.95'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6b7f96,#d3dde7)'><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734; 4.5 (198)</div><h3>Meditation Cushion (Zafu)</h3><p>Buckwheat fill, removable cover</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$38.95</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Meditation Cushion Zafu' data-price='38.95'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#96866b,#e5ddcc)'><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.8 (143)</div><h3>Mat Storage Rack (20 mats)</h3><p>Powder-coated steel, easy build</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$189</span><span class='was'>$229</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Mat Storage Rack (20 mats)' data-price='189'>Add to cart</button></div></div></div><h2 id='packs' style='margin-top:48px'>Studio packs &mdash; outfit a room in one order</h2><p class='sub'>Pre-bundled at wholesale tiers. Need different quantities? <a href='wholesale.html' style='text-decoration:underline'>Ask for a custom quote</a> and we will reply within the hour.</p><div class='grid4'><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2b4f42,#7fa392)'><span class='chip'>Save 35%</span><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 5.0 (214)</div><h3>Studio Starter Pack (10 sets)</h3><p>10 mats + 10 blocks + 10 straps</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$399</span><span class='was'>$614</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Studio Starter Pack (10 sets)' data-price='399'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#33604f,#8fb3a3)'><span class='chip'>Save 38%</span><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.9 (96)</div><h3>Class Pack (25 sets)</h3><p>25 mats + 25 blocks + 25 straps</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$939</span><span class='was'>$1,535</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Class Pack (25 sets)' data-price='939'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3f6f5c,#b6cfc3)'><span class='chip'>Restorative</span><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.9 (61)</div><h3>Restorative Pack (10 sets)</h3><p>10 bolsters + 20 blankets + 10 straps</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$799</span><span class='was'>$1,109</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='Restorative Pack (10 sets)' data-price='799'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tile' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4a6f8a,#c6d7e2)'><span class='chip'>Schools</span><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='body'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 5.0 (44)</div><h3>School &amp; Gym Pack (30 mats)</h3><p>30 classic mats + storage rack</p><div class='prow'><div><span class='price'>$749</span><span class='was'>$1,077</span></div></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-w' data-add='School and Gym Pack (30 mats)' data-price='749'>Add to cart</button></div></div></div></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><div class='band'><div><h2>Need 50, 100 or 500 units?</h2><p>Send your list and we will return a quote with tiered pricing, freight and lead times within 1 business hour. Free sample mat for qualifying studios.</p></div><div><a class='btn btn-p btn-w' href='wholesale.html'>Get my wholesale quote</a></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:820px'><h2>Shopping questions</h2><details class='faq' open><summary>Which mat should I buy?</summary><p>Hot yoga and vinyasa: Pro-Grip 5mm. All-purpose studio use: Classic 1/4&quot;. Sensitive knees or therapeutic work: XL Extra-Thick 8mm. Eco priority: Natural Jute Blend.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>When do bulk discounts apply?</summary><p>Automatically in the cart at 10+ units, with deeper tiers at 25, 50 and 100 units. Mixed products count toward the same tier.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Can I get samples before a large order?</summary><p>Yes. Qualifying studios, schools and gyms can request a free sample mat &mdash; just mention it in your quote request.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>What if it does not work for my practice?</summary><p>Return within 30 days for a refund or exchange. We pay return shipping on defective items, always.</p></details></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fcols'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#8fb3a3'>Direct</span></div><p>Supplying yoga mats and props to studios, schools and home practitioners since 1999.</p><p><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='shop.html#mats'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; props</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#packs'>Studio packs</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Buy in bulk</h4><ul><li><a href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale pricing</a></li><li><a href='wholesale.html#form'>Request a quote</a></li><li><a href='wholesale.html#custom'>Custom logo mats</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='contact.html'>Contact us</a></li><li><a href='about.html'>Our story</a></li><li><a href='contact.html#shipping'>Shipping &amp; returns</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'><span>&copy; 1999&ndash;2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout &middot; Visa &middot; Mastercard &middot; Amex &middot; PayPal &middot; Purchase orders accepted</span></div></div></footer><div class='drawer' id='drawer'><div class='dback' data-close></div><div class='dpanel'><div class='dhead'><strong>Your cart</strong><button class='x' data-close aria-label='Close cart'>&times;</button></div><div class='ditems' id='ditems'><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Your cart is empty.</p></div><div class='dfoot'><div class='ship' id='shipmsg'>Spend $75 to unlock free shipping</div><div class='row'><span>Subtotal</span><strong id='dsub'>$0.00</strong></div><a class='btn btn-p btn-w' href='#'>Secure checkout</a><p class='fine'>30-day returns &middot; Ships in 1 business day &middot; 10+ units save 15%</p></div></div></div><script>(function(){var items=[];var d=document.getElementById('drawer');function open(){d.classList.add('on')}function close(){d.classList.remove('on')}document.querySelectorAll('[data-open]').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',open)});document.querySelectorAll('[data-close]').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',close)});function render(){var box=document.getElementById('ditems');var sub=0;if(!items.length){box.innerHTML='<p style=\\\"color:#5f6b66\\\">Your cart is empty.</p>'}else{box.innerHTML=items.map(function(i){sub+=i.p*i.q;return '<div class=\\\"it\\\"><span>'+i.n+' &times; '+i.q+'</span><strong>$'+(i.p*i.q).toFixed(2)+'</strong></div>'}).join('')}document.getElementById('dsub').textContent='$'+sub.toFixed(2);var left=75-sub;document.getElementById('shipmsg').textContent=left>0?'Spend $'+left.toFixed(2)+' more to unlock free shipping':'Free shipping unlocked!';var c=items.reduce(function(a,i){return a+i.q},0);document.querySelectorAll('[data-cart-count]').forEach(function(e){e.textContent=c})}document.querySelectorAll('[data-add]').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){var n=b.getAttribute('data-add'),p=parseFloat(b.getAttribute('data-price'));var f=items.filter(function(i){return i.n===n})[0];if(f){f.q++}else{items.push({n:n,p:p,q:1})}render();open()})})})();</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/product-pro-grip-mat.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Pro-Grip Yoga Mat 5mm &mdash; $59.95 | YogaDirect</title><meta name='description' content='The Pro-Grip 5mm yoga mat: sweat-proof grip, closed-cell surface, latex-free. 4.8 stars from 2,415 reviews. Free shipping over $75, 30-day returns, bulk pricing from 10 units.'><style>:root{--ink:#1b2a26;--sage:#3f6f5c;--sage-d:#2b4f42;--sand:#f7f3ec;--terra:#d2703a;--terra-d:#b95c2a;--line:#e6e0d6;--muted:#5f6b66}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',