class='wrap'><nav class='nav'><a class='logo' href='index.html'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></a><ul><li><a href='shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Props</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#packs'>Studio Packs</a></li><li><a href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale</a></li><li><a href='about.html'>Our Story</a></li></ul><div class='right'><a class='btn btn-g btn-sm' href='wholesale.html'>Bulk pricing</a><button class='cartbtn' data-open>Cart (<span data-cart-count>0</span>)</button></div></nav></div></header><div class='wrap crumbs'><a href='index.html'>Home</a> / <a href='shop.html'>Yoga mats</a> / Pro-Grip 5mm</div><div class='wrap pdp'><div><div class='mainart'><span class='chip'>#1 best seller</span><div class='shape'></div></div><div class='thumbs'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3f6f5c,#a8c6b8)'></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5c7f9a,#cdd8e4)'></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8a6f96,#ddd0e4)'></div><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c2683f,#efd0be)'></div></div></div><div><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 4.8 &nbsp;<a href='#reviews'>2,415 reviews</a></div><h1>Pro-Grip Yoga Mat &mdash; 5mm</h1><p style='color:var(--muted);margin:0'>The grip our hot-yoga studios reorder every season. Closed-cell surface repels sweat, so it stays hygienic and never gets slick mid-flow.</p><div class='pricerow'><span class='price'>$59.95</span><span class='was'>$79.95</span><span class='save'>Save 25%</span></div><div class='stock'>&#9679; In stock &mdash; order by 2pm ET and it ships today</div><div class='swatches'><span class='sw' style='background:#3f6f5c' title='Forest'></span><span class='sw' style='background:#5c7f9a' title='Slate blue'></span><span class='sw' style='background:#8a6f96' title='Plum'></span><span class='sw' style='background:#c2683f' title='Terracotta'></span><span class='sw' style='background:#1b2a26' title='Charcoal'></span></div><div class='qtyrow'><label for='qty' style='font-weight:700'>Qty</label><input id='qty' type='number' min='1' value='1'><button class='btn btn-p' style='flex:1' data-add='Pro-Grip Yoga Mat 5mm' data-price='59.95' data-usesqty>Add to cart &mdash; $59.95</button></div><a class='btn btn-s btn-w' href='wholesale.html'>Buying 10+? Get studio pricing</a><ul class='tick'><li>Free shipping on orders $75+ (add one more item to qualify)</li><li>30-day return window, no restocking fee</li><li>2-year warranty against peeling and flaking</li><li>Latex-free &middot; phthalate-tested &middot; 6.5 lb, 72&quot; x 26&quot;</li></ul><div class='box'><h3>Buy more, pay less</h3><table class='tiers'><tr><td>1&ndash;9 mats</td><td>$59.95 each</td></tr><tr><td>10&ndash;24 mats</td><td><strong>$50.95 each (15% off)</strong></td></tr><tr><td>25&ndash;49 mats</td><td><strong>$44.95 each (25% off)</strong></td></tr><tr><td>50+ mats</td><td><strong>From $40.75 each + free freight</strong></td></tr></table></div><div class='box'><h3>Frequently bought together</h3><div class='bundle'><div class='t' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b98a5c,#e6d3b8)'></div><div style='flex:1'>Foam Yoga Blocks (2-pack) &mdash; <strong>$14.95</strong> with mat <span style='color:#98a09c;text-decoration:line-through'>$17.95</span></div><button class='btn btn-g btn-sm' data-add='Foam Yoga Blocks 2-pack (bundle)' data-price='14.95'>Add</button></div><div class='bundle'><div class='t' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c2683f,#efd0be)'></div><div style='flex:1'>Cotton Yoga Strap 8ft &mdash; <strong>$7.95</strong> with mat <span style='color:#98a09c;text-decoration:line-through'>$9.95</span></div><button class='btn btn-g btn-sm' data-add='Cotton Yoga Strap 8ft (bundle)' data-price='7.95'>Add</button></div><div class='bundle' style='border:0'><div class='t' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8f7d5c,#e2d8c2)'></div><div style='flex:1'>Grip Mat Towel &mdash; <strong>$22.95</strong> with mat <span style='color:#98a09c;text-decoration:line-through'>$27.95</span></div><button class='btn btn-g btn-sm' data-add='Grip Mat Towel (bundle)' data-price='22.95'>Add</button></div></div></div></div><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><h2>Why teachers pick the Pro-Grip</h2><div class='grid3'><div class='card'><h3>Grip that survives sweat</h3><p>Micro-textured closed-cell top keeps traction in 95&deg;F rooms &mdash; no towel required.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Easy to sanitize</h3><p>Moisture stays on the surface, so a quick wipe-down between classes is all it takes.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Built for daily classes</h3><p>5mm high-density core cushions joints and resists denting through years of use.</p></div></div><div class='card' style='margin-top:20px'><h3>Specs</h3><p>72&quot; x 26&quot; &middot; 5mm thick &middot; 6.5 lb &middot; closed-cell PVC, latex-free, phthalate-tested &middot; 2-year warranty &middot; ships rolled with carry strap included.</p></div></div></section><section class='sec' id='reviews'><div class='wrap'><h2>2,415 reviews &middot; 4.8 average</h2><div class='grid3'><div class='card'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p style='color:var(--ink);margin:8px 0'>&ldquo;Bought 30 for our hot studio. A year later, zero flaking and grip is still excellent.&rdquo;</p><p><strong>Marisol R.</strong> &middot; Verified buyer</p></div><div class='card'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p style='color:var(--ink);margin:8px 0'>&ldquo;Compared it side by side with a $120 brand. Honestly the same grip for half the price.&rdquo;</p><p><strong>Tomas L.</strong> &middot; Verified buyer</p></div><div class='card'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734;</div><p style='color:var(--ink);margin:8px 0'>&ldquo;Great mat, slight smell for two days then gone. Cushion is perfect for my knees.&rdquo;</p><p><strong>Renee W.</strong> &middot; Verified buyer</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:820px'><h2>Shipping, returns &amp; care</h2><details class='faq' open><summary>How fast does it ship?</summary><p>Same business day for orders placed by 2pm ET, from our U.S. warehouse. Standard delivery is 2&ndash;5 business days; expedited options at checkout.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>What if I do not like it?</summary><p>Return within 30 days for a full refund or swap. Defective mats are replaced with prepaid return shipping.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>How do I clean it?</summary><p>Wipe with mild soap and water or a diluted vinegar spray, then air dry flat. Avoid oil-based cleaners.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Do you offer studio quantities and logo printing?</summary><p>Yes &mdash; tiered pricing starts at 10 mats, and custom colors or printed logos are available on 100+ units. <a href='wholesale.html' style='text-decoration:underline'>Request a quote</a>.</p></details></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fcols'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#8fb3a3'>Direct</span></div><p>Yoga mats and props for studios, schools and home practice since 1999.</p><p><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='shop.html#mats'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; props</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#packs'>Studio packs</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Buy in bulk</h4><ul><li><a href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale pricing</a></li><li><a href='wholesale.html#form'>Request a quote</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='contact.html'>Contact us</a></li><li><a href='about.html'>Our story</a></li><li><a href='contact.html#shipping'>Shipping &amp; returns</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'>&copy; 1999&ndash;2025 YogaDirect. Secure checkout &middot; Visa &middot; Mastercard &middot; Amex &middot; PayPal &middot; POs accepted</div></div></footer><div class