ar(--muted);font-size:14.5px}table.tiers{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15.5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}table.tiers th,table.tiers td{text-align:left;padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}table.tiers th{font-size:12.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--muted);background:var(--sand)}.stars{color:#dd9130;font-weight:700}.faq{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:14px 0}.faq summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;font-size:17px}.faq p{color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0}footer.site{background:var(--ink);color:#cfd8d4;padding:52px 0 26px;font-size:14.5px}footer.site h4{color:#fff;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 12px}.fcols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:26px}.fcols ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:8px}.fbot{border-top:1px solid #33443f;margin-top:30px;padding-top:18px;color:#9fada8;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:900px){.hero .g{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:32px 0}h1{font-size:32px}h2{font-size:26px}.grid3,.grid4{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav ul{display:none}.fcols{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}</style></head><body><div class='promo'>Studio pricing desk open 9am&ndash;5pm ET &mdash; quotes returned within <strong>1 business hour</strong> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href='#form'>Request yours</a></div><header class='site'><div class='wrap'><nav class='nav'><a class='logo' href='index.html'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></a><ul><li><a href='shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Props</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#packs'>Studio Packs</a></li><li><a href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale</a></li><li><a href='about.html'>Our Story</a></li></ul><div class='right'><a class='btn btn-p btn-sm' href='#form'>Get a quote</a></div></nav></div></header><section class='hero'><div class='wrap g'><div><div class='eyebrow'>Wholesale &amp; bulk since 1999</div><h1>Outfit your studio for up to 40% less</h1><p class='lead'>We manufacture and source our own mats and props, so studios, schools, gyms, hotels, PT clinics and event organizers buy at true factory-direct pricing &mdash; with no membership fees or annual minimums.</p><ul class='tick'><li>Discounts start at 10 units &mdash; mix and match products</li><li>Free freight on orders of 100+ units</li><li>Net-30 terms available after your first order</li><li>Free sample mat for qualifying studios</li><li>Custom colors and logo printing on 100+ units</li><li>A dedicated rep who remembers your last order</li></ul><div class='card' style='margin-top:24px'><div class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p style='color:var(--ink);margin:8px 0 6px'>&ldquo;We re-mat two rooms every year. YogaDirect quoted in under an hour and beat our old supplier by $1,100 on 40 mats.&rdquo;</p><p><strong>Marisol R.</strong> &middot; Studio owner, Austin TX</p></div></div><div class='formcard' id='form'><h3>Request your wholesale quote</h3><p class='note'>Takes 60 seconds. A real person replies within 1 business hour (9am&ndash;5pm ET) with pricing, freight and lead times.</p><form class='f' data-quote><div class='two'><div><label for='n'>Your name</label><input id='n' required placeholder='Alex Rivera'></div><div><label for='o'>Studio / organization</label><input id='o' required placeholder='Riverbend Yoga'></div></div><div class='two'><div><label for='e'>Email</label><input id='e' type='email' required placeholder='alex@riverbendyoga.com'></div><div><label for='p'>Phone</label><input id='p' placeholder='Optional'></div></div><div class='two'><div><label for='q'>Estimated quantity</label><select id='q'><option>10&ndash;24 units</option><option>25&ndash;49 units</option><option>50&ndash;99 units</option><option>100&ndash;499 units</option><option>500+ units</option></select></div><div><label for='w'>Needed by</label><select id='w'><option>ASAP (this week)</option><option>2&ndash;4 weeks</option><option>1&ndash;3 months</option><option>Just pricing for now</option></select></div></div><div><label for='m'>What do you need?</label><textarea id='m' rows='3' placeholder='e.g. 40 Pro-Grip mats, 40 blocks, 20 bolsters'></textarea></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-w' type='submit'>Send my quote request</button><p class='fine'>No obligation, no spam. We only use your details to prepare your quote. Prefer email? <a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com' style='text-decoration:underline'>sales@yogadirect.com</a></p></form></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><h2>Volume pricing</h2><p style='color:var(--muted);max-width:60ch'>Tiers apply across mixed products &mdash; mats, blocks, straps, bolsters and blankets all count toward the same total.</p><table class='tiers'><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Discount off retail</th><th>Shipping</th><th>Terms</th></tr><tr><td>10&ndash;24 units</td><td><strong>15% off</strong></td><td>Free ground</td><td>Card or PayPal</td></tr><tr><td>25&ndash;49 units</td><td><strong>25% off</strong></td><td>Free ground</td><td>Card, PayPal, PO</td></tr><tr><td>50&ndash;99 units</td><td><strong>32% off</strong></td><td>Free ground</td><td>PO / Net-30 available</td></tr><tr><td>100+ units</td><td><strong>Up to 40% off</strong></td><td>Free freight</td><td>PO / Net-30 + custom options</td></tr></table><div style='margin-top:22px'><a class='btn btn-p' href='#form'>Get my exact pricing</a> <a class='btn btn-s' href='shop.html#packs'>See pre-built studio packs</a></div></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><h2>Who we supply</h2><div class='grid4'><div class='card'><h3>Yoga &amp; pilates studios</h3><p>Class-size mat and prop sets, seasonal re-mats, retail resale programs.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Schools &amp; universities</h3><p>PE and wellness programs with purchase orders and tax-exempt billing.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Gyms, hotels &amp; spas</h3><p>Durable gear for shared use, plus storage racks and sanitizing supplies.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Events &amp; corporate wellness</h3><p>Large one-time orders, drop-ship to venue, branded mats for attendees.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec' id='custom'><div class='wrap grid3'><div class='card'><h3>Custom logo mats</h3><p>Screen printing and custom colorways on 100+ units. Digital proof before production, typical lead time 3&ndash;5 weeks.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Drop-shipping &amp; scheduled releases</h3><p>Ship to multiple locations or hold inventory for staged delivery across a semester or season.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Retail resale program</h3><p>Sell mats, blocks and straps at your front desk with keystone-friendly margins and reorder reminders.</p></div></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:840px'><h2>Wholesale FAQ</h2><details class='faq' open><summary>Do I need a resale certificate or business license?</summary><p>No. Volume pricing is based on quantity, not paperwork. If you are tax-exempt, send your certificate and we will remove sales tax from your quote.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>What are your minimums?</summary><p>Ten units gets you wholesale tier one. There are no annual minimums and no fees to keep your account open.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>How long do bulk orders take?</summary><p>In-stock bulk orders ship in 1&ndash;2 business days, with ground transit of 2&ndash;5 days or freight in 3&ndash;7 days. Custom-printed orders run 3&ndash;5 weeks.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Can I get samples first?</summary><p>Yes &mdash; qualifying studios and schools receive a free sample mat. Additional samples are available at cost and credited against your first order.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Do you accept purchase orders?</summary><p>We accept POs from schools, municipalities and established businesses, and offer net-30 terms after your first paid order.</p></details><div style='margin-top:24px'><a class='btn btn-p' href='#form'>Request a quote now</a> <a class='btn btn-s' href='contact.html'>Talk to a human first</a></div></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fcols'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#8fb3a3'>Direct</span></div><p>Wholesale yoga mats and props for studios, schools and gyms since 1999.</p><p><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='shop.html#mats'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; props</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#packs'>Studio packs</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Buy in bulk</h4><ul><li><a href='#form'>Request a quote</a></li><li><a href='#custom'>Custom logo mats</a></li><li><a href='#'>Volume pricing</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='contact.html'>Contact us</a></li><li><a href='about.html'>Our story</a></li><li><a href='contact.html#shipping'>Shipping &amp; returns</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'>&copy; 1999&ndash;2025 YogaDirect. Purchase orders and net-30 terms available for qualified accounts.</div></div></footer><script>document.querySelectorAll('[data-quote]').forEach(function(f){f.addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();f.innerHTML='<div style=\\\"background:#f7f3ec;border-radius:14px;padding:20px\\\"><h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Request received &mdash; thank you.</h3><p style=\\\"margin:0;color:#5f6b66\\\">A studio specialist will email your quote within 1 business hour (9am&ndash;5pm ET). Need it faster? Email sales@yogadirect.com with \\\\'RUSH\\\\' in the subject.</p></div>'})});</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/about.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Our Story &mdash; Supplying the Yoga Community Since 1999 | YogaDirect</title><meta name='description' content='YogaDirect has supplied yoga mats and props since 1999. We manufacture and source our own goods so studios, schools and home practitioners get quality gear at direct prices.'><style>:root{--ink:#1b2a26;--sage:#3f6f5c;--sage-d:#2b4f42;--sand:#f7f3ec;--terra:#d2703a;--terra-d:#b95c2a;--line:#e6e0d6;--muted:#5f6b66}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.65;background:#fff}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.narrow{max-width:760px}.promo{background:var(--sage-d);color:#fff;font-size:14px;text-align:center;padding:9px 12px}.promo a{text-decoration:underline;font-weight:700}header.site{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:14px 0}.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.6px}.logo span{color:var(--sage)}.nav ul{display:flex;gap:20px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;font-weight:600;font-size:15px}.nav .right{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:10px}.btn{display:inline-block;border:0;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:999px;padding:15px 28px;text-align:center}.btn-p{background:var(--terra);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(210,112,58,.28)}.btn-s{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border:2px solid var(--ink)}.btn-g{background:var(--sage);color:#fff}.btn-sm{padding:11px 18px;font-size:14px}h1{font-size:44px;letter-spacing:-1.4px;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px}h2{font-size:29px;letter-spacing:-.9px;margin:34px 0 10px}.lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted)}.hero{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f7f3ec,#edf2ee);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:52px 0}.sec{padding:52px 0}.sec.alt{background:var(--sand)}.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.grid4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;text-align:center}.card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:#fff;padding:22px}.card h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:18px}.card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px}.stat b{display:block;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.6px}.stat span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.cta{background:var(--sage-d);color:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:32px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:22px;align-items:center}.cta h2{margin:0 0 6px;color:#fff}.cta p{margin:0;color:#d9e5df}footer.site{background:var(--ink);color:#cfd8d4;padding:52px 0 26px;font-size:14.5px}footer.site h4{color:#fff;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 12px}.fcols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:26px}.fcols ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:8px}.fbot{border-top:1px solid #33443f;margin-top:30px;padding-top:18px;color:#9fada8;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:900px){h1{font-size:31px}h2{font-size:24px}.grid3,.grid4{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.cta{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav ul{display:none}.fcols{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}</style></head><body><div class='promo'>Free U.S. shipping on orders $75+ &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href='wholesale.html'>Studios save up to 40% with wholesale pricing</a></div><header class='site'><div class='wrap'><nav class='nav'><a class='logo' href='index.html'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></a><ul><li><a href='shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Props</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#packs'>Studio Packs</a></li><li><a href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale</a></li><li><a href='about.html'>Our Story</a></li></ul><div class='right'><a class='btn btn-g btn-sm' href='shop.html'>Shop now</a></div></nav></div></header><section class='hero'><div class='wrap narrow'><h1>From our team of yoga lovers to you</h1><p class='lead'>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the yoga community since 1999 &mdash; and we would like to help you grow your studio, your event or your personal practice.</p></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap narrow'><h2>Why we can price the way we do</h2><p>We manufacture and source our own goods. That means no middlemen, no licensing fees and no boutique markup &mdash; just consistent, high-quality yoga gear at prices that make sense whether you need one mat or three hundred.</p><h2>Quality you can feel on the mat</h2><p>Every product we carry is used and tested by people who practice. We write our own specs, hold our factories to them, and pull anything that does not hold up to daily studio use. If a batch is not right, it does not ship.</p><h2>Service from actual humans</h2><p>Studio owners get a dedicated rep who knows their reorder history, their room size and their timeline. Home practitioners get straight answers about thickness, grip and care &mdash; not a chatbot loop.</p><h2>Growing the community, not just the cart</h2><p>When you shop at YogaDirect, you are helping grow your own practice or business and the wider yoga community. We have supported studios, schools, non-profits and teacher trainings for over two decades, and we intend to keep doing it.</p></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><div class='grid4'><div class='card stat'><b>1999</b><span>Serving yoga since</span></div><div class='card stat'><b>1M+</b><span>Mats shipped</span></div><div class='card stat'><b>4,000+</b><span>Studios &amp; schools supplied</span></div><div class='card stat'><b>4.8/5</b><span>From 12,000+ reviews</span></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><h2 style='margin-top:0'>What we promise every order</h2><div class='grid3'><div class='card'><h3>Ships fast</h3><p>Orders in by 2pm ET leave our U.S. warehouse the same business day.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>30-day guarantee</h3><p>Practice on it. If it is not right, return it within 30 days &mdash; no restocking fees.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Fair, transparent pricing</h3><p>Volume discounts published up front, no membership fees, no surprise freight bills.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><div class='cta'><div><h2>Let us help you build your space</h2><p>Shop factory-direct today, or send us your list and get a wholesale quote back within 1 business hour.</p></div><div style='display:grid;gap:10px'><a class='btn btn-p' href='shop.html'>Shop best sellers</a><a class='btn' style='background:#fff;color:#1b2a26' href='wholesale.html'>Get a wholesale quote</a></div></div></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fcols'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#8fb3a3'>Direct</span></div><p>Supplying yoga mats and props to studios, schools and home practitioners since 1999.</p><p><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='shop.html#mats'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; props</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#packs'>Studio packs</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Buy in bulk</h4><ul><li><a href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale pricing</a></li><li><a href='wholesale.html#form'>Request a quote</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='contact.html'>Contact us</a></li><li><a href='contact.html#shipping'>Shipping &amp; returns</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'>&copy; 1999&ndash;2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</div></div></footer></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/contact.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Contact YogaDirect &mdash; Help with Orders, Shipping &amp; Bulk Pricing</title><meta name='description' content='Contact the YogaDirect team for help choosing gear, order status, returns or wholesale pricing. Replies within 1 business hour, 9am-5pm ET.'><style>:root{--ink:#1b2a26;--sage:#3f6f5c;--sage-d:#2b4f42;--sand:#f7f3ec;--terra:#d2703a;--terra-d:#b95c2a;--line:#e6e0d6;--muted:#5f6b66}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.65;background:#fff}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.promo{background:var(--sage-d);color:#fff;font-size:14px;text-align:center;padding:9px 12px}.promo a{text-decoration:underline;font-weight:700}header.site{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:14px 0}.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.6px}.logo span{color:var(--sage)}.nav ul{display:flex;gap:20px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;font-weight:600;font-size:15px}.nav .right{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:10px}.btn{display:inline-block;border:0;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:999px;padding:15px 28px;text-align:center}.btn-p{background:var(--terra);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(210,112,58,.28)}.btn-s{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border:2px solid var(--ink)}.btn-g{background:var(--sage);color:#fff}.btn-sm{padding:11px 18px;font-size:14px}.btn-w{width:100%}h1{font-size:40px;letter-spacing:-1.3px;margin:0 0 12px}h2{font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-.8px;margin:0 0 12px}.lead{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);max-width:62ch}.hero{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f7f3ec,#edf2ee);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:46px 0}.sec{padding:50px 0}.sec.alt{background:var(--sand)}.g2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:34px;align-items:start}.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}.card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:#fff;padding:22px}.card h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:18px}.card p{margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px}.f{display:grid;gap:12px}.f label{font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.f input,.f select,.f textarea{width:100%;padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;font:inherit}.f .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.fine{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}.faq{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:14px 0}.faq summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;font-size:17px}.faq p{color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0}footer.site{background:var(--ink);color:#cfd8d4;padding:52px 0 26px;font-size:14.5px}footer.site h4{color:#fff;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 12px}.fcols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:26px}.fcols ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:8px}.fbot{border-top:1px solid #33443f;margin-top:30px;padding-top:18px;color:#9fada8;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:900px){h1{font-size:29px}.g2,.grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav ul{display:none}.fcols{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}</style></head><body><div class='promo'>Need help fast? Email <a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a> &mdash; real replies within 1 business hour, 9am&ndash;5pm ET</div><header class='site'><div class='wrap'><nav class='nav'><a class='logo' href='index.html'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></a><ul><li><a href='shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Props</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#packs'>Studio Packs</a></li><li><a href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale</a></li><li><a href='about.html'>Our Story</a></li></ul><div class='right'><a class='btn btn-g btn-sm' href='shop.html'>Shop now</a></div></nav></div></header><section class='hero'><div class='wrap'><h1>How can we help?</h1><p class='lead'>Whether you are choosing your first mat or re-matting three studio rooms, a real person on our team will get you a straight answer &mdash; usually within the hour.</p></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap g2'><div><h2>Send us a message</h2><form class='f' data-contact><div class='two'><div><label for='n'>Name</label><input id='n' required placeholder='Alex Rivera'></div><div><label for='e'>Email</label><input id='e' type='email' required placeholder='you@email.com'></div></div><div><label for='t'>What is this about?</label><select id='t'><option>Help choosing a product</option><option>Bulk / wholesale pricing</option><option>Order status or shipping</option><option>Return or exchange</option><option>Custom logo printing</option><option>Something else</option></select></div><div><label for='o'>Order number (if you have one)</label><input id='o' placeholder='Optional'></div><div><label for='m'>Message</label><textarea id='m' rows='5' required placeholder='Tell us what you need and any deadline you are working with.'></textarea></div><button class='btn btn-p btn-w' type='submit'>Send message</button><p class='fine'>We reply to every message. Average first response: under 1 business hour, 9am&ndash;5pm ET, Monday&ndash;Friday.</p></form></div><div><div class='grid3' style='grid-template-columns:1fr'><div class='card'><h3>Buying 10 or more units?</h3><p>Skip the back-and-forth &mdash; use the quote form and we will send tiered pricing, freight and lead times.</p><a class='btn btn-p btn-sm' href='wholesale.html#form'>Get a wholesale quote</a></div><div class='card'><h3>Order status</h3><p>Tracking is emailed as soon as your order leaves the warehouse. Cannot find it? Email us your order number and we will resend.</p><a class='btn btn-s btn-sm' href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>Email support</a></div><div class='card'><h3>Not sure which mat?</h3><p>Tell us your style of practice and we will recommend a thickness and surface &mdash; or start with our best seller.</p><a class='btn btn-s btn-sm' href='product-pro-grip-mat.html'>See the Pro-Grip mat</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class='sec alt' id='shipping'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:840px'><h2>Shipping, returns &amp; policies</h2><details class='faq' open><summary>Shipping times and costs</summary><p>Free ground shipping on U.S. orders over $75; flat-rate shipping below that. Orders placed by 2pm ET ship the same business day. Standard delivery is 2&ndash;5 business days; freight for bulk orders is 3&ndash;7 business days. Expedited options are available at checkout.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Returns and exchanges</summary><p>Return unused items within 30 days for a refund or exchange &mdash; no restocking fee. Defective items are replaced with prepaid return shipping. Custom-printed orders are final sale once the proof is approved.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Warranty</summary><p>Mats carry a 2-year warranty against peeling, flaking and delamination under normal use. Props are warranted against manufacturing defects for 1 year.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Purchase orders, tax exemption &amp; net-30</summary><p>We accept POs from schools, municipalities and established businesses, and offer net-30 terms after a first paid order. Send your tax-exemption certificate with your quote request and we will remove sales tax.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Do you ship outside the U.S.?</summary><p>We ship to Canada and select international destinations for bulk orders. Contact us with your quantities and destination for a freight quote.</p></details></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fcols'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#8fb3a3'>Direct</span></div><p>Supplying yoga mats and props to studios, schools and home practitioners since 1999.</p><p><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='shop.html#mats'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; props</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#packs'>Studio packs</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Buy in bulk</h4><ul><li><a href='wholesale.html'>Wholesale pricing</a></li><li><a href='wholesale.html#form'>Request a quote</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='contact.html'>Contact us</a></li><li><a href='about.html'>Our story</a></li><li><a href='#shipping'>Shipping &amp; returns</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'>&copy; 1999&ndash;2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</div></div></footer><script>document.querySelectorAll('[data-contact]').forEach(function(f){f.addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();f.innerHTML='<div style=\\\"background:#f7f3ec;border-radius:14px;padding:20px\\\"><h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Message sent</h3><p style=\\\"margin:0;color:#5f6b66\\\">Thanks &mdash; we will reply within 1 business hour (9am&ndash;5pm ET). Shopping in the meantime? <a href=\\\"shop.html\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration:underline\\\">Browse best sellers</a>.</p></div>'})});</script></body></html>\"}],\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Rebuilt the homepage around a clear value proposition hero (\\\"Studio-grade yoga mats & props at factory-direct prices\\\") with two prioritized CTAs: Shop best sellers and Get wholesale pricing.\",\"Why\":\"The original homepage led with an unstructured \\\"Featured Products\\\" label and a paragraph of company history, giving visitors no immediate reason to buy or obvious next step. A benefit-led hero with primary/secondary CTAs is the single biggest driver of first-click conversion.\"},{\"What\":\"Added a persistent promo bar with the free-shipping threshold ($75+) and a wholesale quote link on every page.\",\"Why\":\"Shipping cost is the top cause of cart abandonment; stating the threshold up front raises both conversion and average order value, while the bulk link routes high-value B2B traffic immediately.\"},{\"What\":\"Created a dedicated wholesale/bulk page with a short lead-capture quote form, published volume discount tiers (15%/25%/32%/up to 40%), free-freight and net-30 details, segment-specific copy (studios, schools, gyms, events) and a wholesale FAQ.\",\"Why\":\"YogaDirect's own copy says it supplies studios and events, but there was no visible bulk funnel. A quantified tier table plus a low-friction form converts high-ticket B2B intent that otherwise leaves the site.\"},{\"What\":\"Built a real shop page with category sections (mats, props, studio packs), filter chips, prices, ratings, badges and add-to-cart on every card.\",\"Why\":\"Products, prices and reviews had no discoverable structure. Showing price, social proof and a one-click add on the grid shortens the path to purchase and reduces bounce from the landing page.\"},{\"What\":\"Added a full product detail page (Pro-Grip 5mm) with gallery, star reviews, price anchoring, stock/cut-off-time urgency, color swatches, quantity selector, per-unit volume pricing table, and a \\\"frequently bought together\\\" bundle module.\",\"Why\":\"PDPs are where purchase decisions happen. Price anchoring, scarcity/shipping cut-off, and bundle upsells lift both conversion rate and order value; the quantity tiers nudge single-mat buyers toward multi-unit orders.\"},{\"What\":\"Implemented a working mini-cart drawer with subtotal and a dynamic \\\"spend $X more for free shipping\\\" progress message, plus a sticky add-to-cart bar on mobile PDP.\",\"Why\":\"Immediate cart feedback and a free-shipping gap message are proven AOV boosters, and a persistent mobile CTA prevents drop-off on long product pages.\"},{\"What\":\"Layered trust and social proof throughout: 25+ years / 1M+ mats / 4,000+ studios stat bar, 4.8-star review counts, named customer testimonials, warranty, 30-day returns and secure-payment mentions in the footer.\",\"Why\":\"The original site offered credibility only as an unsupported paragraph. Concrete numbers, reviews and guarantee language reduce perceived purchase risk, which is critical for an unfamiliar direct brand competing with premium labels.\"},{\"What\":\"Added an email capture offering 10% off the first order, with inline success state.\",\"Why\":\"Most first-time visitors do not buy on visit one; an incentivized list build creates a low-cost channel to recover that traffic and drive repeat revenue.\"},{\"What\":\"Introduced bundled \\\"Studio Packs\\\" (starter, class, restorative, school/gym) with clear savings versus itemized pricing.\",\"Why\":\"Pre-built bundles remove the effort of assembling a large order, raise average order value substantially, and directly serve the studio/school customers the brand already sells to.\"},{\"What\":\"Created a conversion-oriented contact page with a routed subject selector, a bulk-buyer shortcut, response-time promise, and consolidated shipping/returns/warranty/PO policy FAQ.\",\"Why\":\"Unanswered questions about shipping, returns, tax exemption and POs stall both consumer and institutional purchases; answering them on-site removes friction without a support ticket.\"},{\"What\":\"Rewrote the About/brand story page to keep the original heritage message but frame it as buyer benefits (own manufacturing, tested quality, dedicated reps) with CTAs at the end.\",\"Why\":\"Brand narrative alone does not convert; tying \\\"since 1999\\\" and \\\"we manufacture our own goods\\\" to price and reliability benefits makes the story a purchase reason, and closing CTAs recapture readers.\"},{\"What\":\"Added consistent navigation, footer link architecture, breadcrumbs, descriptive page titles/meta descriptions, semantic headings and a mobile-responsive layout across all pages.\",\"Why\":\"Clear site structure and mobile usability improve organic discovery, page-to-page flow and mobile conversion, where the majority of retail traffic now originates.\"},{\"What\":\"Note on content: product names, prices, discount tiers, review counts and policy specifics are realistic placeholders used to demonstrate the conversion structure.\",\"Why\":\"These must be replaced with YogaDirect's real catalog, pricing, review data and policies before launch so all claims remain accurate and compliant.\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'll go ahead and fetch the website to see what's there.That fetch didn't return much, so I should try pulling other subpages to get a better sense of the site's structure.Since I can only fetch the given URL, I'll build an improved, self-contained site based on what I know about YogaDirect—a yoga mats and props retailer selling wholesale and retail since 1999. I'm planning a full conversion-optimized set of pages: homepage, shop/collections, wholesale, a sample product page, about, contact, and FAQ/shipping, all with consistent navigation and inline styling, starting with a sticky header design.\n\nI'm mapping out the page structure with a free shipping bar, hero CTA, trust badges, category grid, bestsellers with pricing and ratings, a wholesale/bulk CTA since that's a key revenue driver for studios, testimonials, an email capture offering a discount, FAQ, and footer—using simple static file paths like /index.html, /shop.html, /wholesale.html so everything links correctly. I'm also planning a shared CSS block reused across pages, plus a mini cart drawer with JS for adding items, bulk discount messaging, and a sticky mobile CTA.\n\nNow I'm settling on the brand palette—sage green, warm sand, ink, and a terracotta accent for high-contrast CTAs—and sketching out the homepage sections: a promo bar, header with nav and search/cart icons, a hero emphasizing durability and factory-direct pricing, trust stats, a six-item category grid, four bestseller products with pricing and ratings, and a bulk savings band showing quantity discounts.\n\nI'm rounding out the remaining sections—value props, testimonials with studio names, an email capture offer, an FAQ accordion covering shipping/returns/bulk/lead times, and a footer with contact info—then inventing a plausible product lineup with prices: mats, blocks, straps, a bolster, and a blanket.\n\nI'm planning the site structure: a shop page with a filterable product grid, a detailed product page for the pro grip mat with gallery and bundle upsells, a wholesale page with a quote form and tiered pricing, plus combined about/contact/FAQ content, adding up to six HTML pages total.\n\nFor the cart, I'm keeping it lightweight with localStorage tracking item counts and a simple drawer, where adding an item triggers a toast and updates the badge. Since the output needs to be valid single-line JSON, I'll write the HTML without literal newlines, using spaces instead to keep things clean and avoid escaping issues.\n\nTo sidestep heavy quote-escaping, I'll use single quotes for HTML attributes throughout, reserving double quotes for nothing in particular, and handle apostrophes in text by rewording or using an entity. JavaScript will live inside script blocks rather than inline attributes, so I can use single-quoted strings freely, and I'll use data attributes with event listeners instead of inline onclick handlers to avoid quoting conflicts altogether.\n\nNow I'm drafting the shared CSS: defining root color variables for ink, sage, sand, and terra tones, setting up base typography with Inter font and a clean line-height, then building the sticky header, promo bar, and container wrapper styles.\n\nStill writing button styles...\n\nFor the hero section, I'm thinking through a two-column grid with a sand background, and deciding to avoid external image dependencies by using CSS gradient blocks with bold typography instead of risky placeholder URLs.\n\nStill writing hero styles...\n\nAdding category cards with hover effects, product cards with pricing and star ratings, a bulk pricing table, testimonials, email signup, FAQ accordion, footer, and a hidden cart drawer that slides in via JS toggle.\n\nI'm adding mobile responsive stacking for the nav, then writing the shared cart JavaScript that tracks added items, updates a badge count, and opens the drawer panel when items are added.\n\nWriting drawer markup...\n\nNow I'm planning the wholesale page form fields with required markers and a \"response within 1 business hour\" trust note, then moving to write a single shared CSS block covering all pages' classes, defining the color variables and base styles.\n\nStill writing styles...\n\nAdding button variant styles...\n\nNow I'm planning the remaining sections—hero, grids, product cards, quotes, form, FAQ, footer, and drawer—plus responsive media queries, keeping product tile art simple with gradient backgrounds and a basic centered shape rather than complex icons.\n\nI'll invent a plausible review count and rating for demo purposes, then move into writing the actual HTML file. I'm planning extras like studio pack savings, a free swatch offer for wholesale leads, a sticky mobile add-to-cart bar, and FAQ sections using collapsible details elements. For the footer I'll include a placeholder phone number and contact info alongside the usual columns and payment icons.\n\nRather than inventing a fake phone number, I'll keep things safer by using email addresses like sales@yogadirect.com and support@yogadirect.com, with a note about fast reply times. Now I'm ready to write out the full page, including a 10-14 item improvements list and the navigation links across index, shop, wholesale, and product pages.\n\nI'm drafting the index.html content: a promo bar about free shipping and wholesale savings, a nav with Yoga Mats, Props, Studio Packs, Wholesale, and About links plus Help and Cart, and a hero section emphasizing factory-direct pricing and studio-grade quality since 1999.\n\nNow I'm adding CTAs for shopping best sellers and wholesale pricing, trust-building ticks about shipping speed and bulk discounts, floating review cards, a trust bar with stats on years in business and mats shipped, and starting a shop-by-category section with pricing for mats and blocks.\n\nContinuing with more categories like wedges, straps, bolsters, blankets, and studio packs, then best sellers with add-to-cart buttons, a bulk pricing tier table with discount percentages, a quote CTA, why-us section, reviews, newsletter signup offering 10% off, FAQ, footer, and the drawer script. Now I'm starting the shop.html page with its header, breadcrumb, and heading for shopping mats and props.\n\nI'm planning out the shop page's filter chips, twelve product cards, bulk banner, and small FAQ, then moving to the product detail page for the pro-grip mat with its gallery, pricing, quantity selector, bulk pricing table, bundle upsell checkboxes, specs, and sticky mobile bar. I'm also sketching the wholesale page with its lead capture form and tiers, and the about page covering the company's history since 1999, manufacturing, and sustainability story.\n\nNow I'm outlining the contact page with its options, form, FAQ links, and hours, then planning to write one shared CSS file to paste across all six pages, defining the section, grid, card, pricing, form, and footer classes along with responsive breakpoints for mobile layouts.\n\nWriting responsive breakpoints...","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'll go ahead and fetch the website to see what's there.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""},{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"That fetch didn't return much, so I should try pulling other subpages to get a better sense of the site's structure.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":1,"signature":""},{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Since I can only fetch the given URL, I'll build an improved, self-contained site based on what I know about YogaDirect—a yoga mats and props retailer selling wholesale and retail since 1999. I'm planning a full conversion-optimized set of pages: homepage, shop/collections, wholesale, a sample product page, about, contact, and FAQ/shipping, all with consistent navigation and inline styling, starting with a sticky header design.\n\nI'm mapping out the page structure with a free shipping bar, hero CTA, trust badges, category grid, bestsellers with pricing and ratings, a wholesale/bulk CTA since that's a key revenue driver for studios, testimonials, an email captur