the PDP using radio inputs, and a free shipping progress message. Now I'll draft the final HTML pages along with a list of roughly ten improvements.\n\nWriting the index page markup, starting with the head metadata and then the hero section copy—trust badges, headline, and lead text emphasizing direct manufacturer pricing.\n\nNow I'm drafting the CTA buttons and microtrust line, plus a bulk-pricing hero card highlighting studio/school discounts with a quote request button and savings callout.\n\nI'm adding trust badges (since 1999, mats shipped, studios served), product category tiles, a bestsellers grid with pricing and stock info, a two-column bulk pricing section with a tier table and quote form, and starter kit bundles with discounted pricing.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":2,"signature":""}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":5718,"completion_tokens":9315,"total_tokens":15033,"cost":0.261465,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.261465,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.02859,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.232875},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":7847,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0},"server_tool_use_details":{"web_search_requests":0}}}
