pan><p>“The 1/4\\\" deluxe mat has great cushion for my knees and it still looks new after two years of daily practice.”</p><b>Dev P.</b><span>Verified buyer</span></div><div class='testi'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p>“Ordered 120 mats for a corporate wellness event. Their rep handled freight and everything arrived early.”</p><b>Karen S.</b><span>Event planner</span></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap grid2'><div><h2>From our team of yoga lovers to you</h2><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p><a class='btn btn-d' href='/about.html'>Our story &amp; guarantee</a></div><div class='stats'><div class='stat'><b>1999</b><span>Serving yogis since</span></div><div class='stat'><b>6,000+</b><span>Studios supplied</span></div><div class='stat'><b>60-day</b><span>Returns</span></div><div class='stat'><b>1 day</b><span>Order handling</span></div></div></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><div class='news'><h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2><p style='opacity:.9;margin:0'>Join 80,000 practitioners for restock alerts, sequences and subscriber-only sales.</p><form onsubmit=\\\"event.preventDefault();this.innerHTML='<p style=&quot;font-weight:700;margin:0&quot;>You are in! Use code WELCOME10 at checkout.</p>'\\\"><input type='email' required placeholder='you@email.com'><button class='btn btn-p' type='submit'>Get My Code</button></form><small style='opacity:.75'>No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.</small></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:820px'><h2 style='text-align:center'>Questions before you buy?</h2><details class='acc'><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><div>In-stock orders placed before 1pm PT ship the same or next business day from our US warehouse. Most orders arrive in 2–5 business days.</div></details><details class='acc'><summary>What if the mat is not right for me?</summary><div>Return any unused item within 60 days for a full refund. If a product fails in normal use, we replace it — just contact us.</div></details><details class='acc'><summary>Do you offer discounts for studios and teachers?</summary><div>Yes. Volume pricing starts at 6 units and teachers get a standing 10% discount. <a class='link' href='/wholesale.html'>Request pricing here.</a></div></details><details class='acc'><summary>Is shipping really free?</summary><div>Ground shipping is free on orders over $75 to the contiguous US. Bulk and freight orders are quoted at cost.</div></details></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<i style='color:#7fd2bd'>Direct</i></div><p style='max-width:320px'>Manufacturer-direct yoga mats and props since 1999. Questions? Call <b style='color:#fff'>1-800-916-4642</b> or email support@yogadirect.com.</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/shop.html#mats'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Straps</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#restore'>Bolsters &amp; Blankets</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#bundles'>Bundles &amp; Kits</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Business</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Wholesale &amp; Bulk</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html#teacher'>Teacher Discount</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html#events'>Events &amp; Retreats</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/faq.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</