8' rx='6' fill='#128069'/><path d='M34 36h52M34 46h52M34 56h34' stroke='#dff0ea' stroke-width='3'/></svg></div></div></div><div><h1>Deluxe 1/4\\\" Yoga Mat</h1><div style='font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span> <b style='color:var(--ink)'>4.8</b> · 1,842 reviews · <a class='link' href='#reviews'>Read reviews</a></div><div class='price'>$24.95 <s>$34.95</s><span class='save'>Save 29%</span></div><div class='stock'>● In stock — only 34 left in Deep Teal</div><p style='margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted)'>Our thickest everyday mat. A full 1/4\\\" of high-density cushioning protects knees and wrists, while the textured non-slip surface holds through sweaty flows. 68\\\" x 24\\\", latex-free, made to studio standards.</p><div class='opts'><label>COLOR: <span id='cname' style='font-weight:600;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0'>Deep Teal</span></label><div class='swatches' id='sw'></div><label>QUANTITY DISCOUNT</label><table class='tiers'><tr><td>1–5 mats</td><td>$24.95 ea</td></tr><tr><td>6–19 mats</td><td>$21.95 ea (save 12%)</td></tr><tr><td>20+ mats</td><td>$17.95 ea (save 28%)</td></tr></table></div><div class='qtyrow'><div class='qty'><button onclick='q(-1)'>−</button><span id='qv'>1</span><button onclick='q(1)'>+</button></div><div style='font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)' id='unit'>$24.95 each</div></div><button class='btn btn-p full' onclick='addMain()'>Add to Cart — <span id='tot'>$24.95</span></button><button class='btn btn-o full' style='margin-top:10px' onclick=\\\"add('KIT-START');\\\">Add Starter Kit instead (mat + 2 blocks + strap, save $20)</button><ul class='assure'><li>Free shipping on orders $75+ · flat $6.95 under</li><li>Ships within 1 business day from our US warehouse</li><li>60-day no-hassle returns</li><li>Buying 6+? <a class='link' href='/wholesale.html'>Get a wholesale quote</a></li></ul></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><h2>Why practitioners choose this mat</h2><div class='grid4'><div class='card'><b>1/4\\\" cushioning</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px'>High-density foam that protects knees in low lunges and kneeling poses.</p></div><div class='card'><b>Non-slip texture</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px'>Closed-cell surface grips both hands and hardwood floors.</p></div><div class='card'><b>68\\\" x 24\\\" standard</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px'>Fits studio racks and cubbies; 2.2 lb so it travels easily.</p></div><div class='card'><b>Easy to clean</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px'>Wipe down with mild soap — built for high-traffic studio use.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec' id='reviews'><div class='wrap'><h2>1,842 verified reviews · 4.8 average</h2><div class='grid3'><div class='card'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p style='margin:8px 0'>“Bought 24 for our studio. Great grip, and students constantly ask where we got them.”</p><b>Marisa L.</b> <span style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px'>· Verified buyer</span></div><div class='card'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p style='margin:8px 0'>“My knees thank me. The extra thickness makes a real difference and it does not slide.”</p><b>Dev P.</b> <span style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px'>· Verified buyer</span></div><div class='card'><span class='stars'>★★★★☆</span><p style='margin:8px 0'>“Slight new-mat smell for a day, then perfect. Fantastic value for the price.”</p><b>Alicia R.</b> <span style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px'>· Verified buyer</span></div></div></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><h2>Complete your practice</h2><div class='grid4' id='cross'></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:820px'><h2 style='text-align:center'>Shipping, returns &amp; details</h2><details class='acc' open><summary>Shipping</summary><div>Orders placed before 1pm PT ship the same busin