30 studio mats for half of what our old supplier charged.” — Marisa L., Portland OR</p></div><div class='form' id='quote'><h2 style='font-size:22px'>Get your bulk quote today</h2><p style='color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px'>Tell us what you need. A rep replies within one business day — usually the same day.</p><form onsubmit=\\\"event.preventDefault();this.innerHTML='<div style=&quot;padding:18px 0&quot;><h3 style=&quot;color:#0f6e5c&quot;>Request received ✓</h3><p>Your quote is on the way. Need it faster? Call 1-800-916-4642 and mention a web quote request.</p></div>'\\\"><label>Studio / organization name</label><input required placeholder='Sunrise Yoga Studio'><label>Your name</label><input required placeholder='Full name'><label>Work email</label><input required type='email' placeholder='you@studio.com'><label>Phone (optional)</label><input placeholder='(555) 555-5555'><label>What do you need?</label><select><option>Yoga mats — 6 to 20</option><option>Yoga mats — 21 to 50</option><option>Yoga mats — 50+</option><option>Blocks, straps &amp; props</option><option>Bolsters &amp; blankets</option><option>Mixed studio outfitting</option><option>Event / retreat giveaway (custom)</option></select><label>Notes, quantities or deadline</label><textarea rows='3' placeholder='e.g. 24 mats + 48 blocks needed by Oct 1'></textarea><button class='btn btn-p full' style='margin-top:14px' type='submit'>Send My Quote Request</button><small style='display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px'>No obligation, no minimum commitment. We never share your details.</small></form></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><h2>Volume pricing at a glance</h2><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Example pricing for our best-selling Deluxe 1/4\\\" mat. Props, bolsters and blankets follow the same tier structure.</p><table class='tiers'><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Price per mat</th><th>You save</th></tr><tr><td>1–5</td><td>$24.95</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>6–19</td><td>$21.95</td><td>12%</td></tr><tr><td>20–49</td><td>$17.95</td><td>28%</td></tr><tr><td>50+</td><td>Custom quote</td><td>up to 40%</td></tr></table></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><h2>Built for people who buy in quantity</h2><div class='grid4'><div class='card'><b>Dedicated rep</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px'>One person who knows your studio, your colors and your reorder cycle.</p></div><div class='card'><b>Freight handled</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px'>Pallet and LTL shipping quoted at cost, delivered on your schedule.</p></div><div class='card'><b>Net-30 terms</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px'>Approved studios, schools and municipalities can order on account.</p></div><div class='card'><b>Consistent stock</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px'>We manufacture our core line, so colors match across reorders.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec' id='teacher'><div class='wrap grid3'><div class='card'><h2 style='font-size:21px'>Teacher discount</h2><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Certified instructors get a standing 10% off every order, plus early access to closeouts. Send us your certificate and we will set up your account.</p><a class='btn btn-o' href='#quote'>Apply for teacher pricing</a></div><div class='card' id='events'><h2 style='font-size:21px'>Events &amp; retreats</h2><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Need 100+ mats for a festival, corporate wellness day or retreat? We handle logistics, custom colors and drop-shipping to the venue.</p><a class='btn btn-o' href='#quote'>Request event pricing</a></div><div class='card'><h2 style='font-size:21px'>Schools &amp; nonprofits</h2><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Purchase orders welcome. Special education pricing for schools, VA programs, studios in training and community nonprofits.</p><a class='btn btn-o' href='#quote'>Get institutional pricing</a></div></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap' style='text-align:center'><h2>Prefer to talk it through?</h2><p style='color:var(--muted)'>Call <b>1-800-916-4642</b> Monday–Friday, 9–5 PT, or email <b>wholesale@yogadirect.com</b>.</p><a class='btn btn-p' href='#quote'>Start My Quote →</a></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<i style='color:#7fd2bd'>Direct</i></div><p style='max-width:320px'>Manufacturer-direct yoga mats and props since 1999.</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/shop.html#mats'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Straps</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#bundles'>Bundles</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Business</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Wholesale &amp; Bulk</a></li><li><a href='#teacher'>Teacher Discount</a></li><li><a href='#events'>Events &amp; Retreats</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/faq.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a></li><li><a href='/about.html'>About Us</a></li><li><a href='/cart.html'>View Cart</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'><span>© 2024 YogaDirect.</span><span>wholesale@yogadirect.com · 1-800-916-4642</span></div></div></footer></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/about.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>About YogaDirect — Supplying the Yoga Community Since 1999</title><meta name='description' content='YogaDirect has supplied yoga mats and props since 1999. We manufacture and source our own goods so studios and practitioners get high quality gear at amazing prices.'><style>:root{--ink:#17262b;--muted:#5c6b70;--brand:#0f6e5c;--dark:#0a4f42;--accent:#e2703a;--sand:#f8f5f0;--line:#e7e2d9}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}h1{font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.15}h2{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 12px}p{margin:0 0 16px}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.narrow{max-width:760px}.promo{background:var(--dark);color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;text-align:center;padding:9px 34px;position:relative}.promo b{color:#ffd68a}.promo button{position:absolute;right:10px;top:4px;background:none;border:0;color:#fff;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer}header.site{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.hrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:12px 0}.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:22px}.logo i{color:var(--brand);font-style:normal}nav.main{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;flex-wrap:wrap}.hact{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}.phone{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand);text-align:right;line-height:1.25}.phone small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}.icbtn{background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;padding:6px;font:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:15px}.burger{display:none;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 11px;cursor:pointer}.btn{display:inline-block;border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:15px 26px;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;text-align:center}.btn-p{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(226,112,58,.28)}.btn-o{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--ink)}.hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--sand),#fff);padding:46px 0}.sec{padding:46px 0}.sec.alt{background:var(--sand)}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}.stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;text-align:center}.stat b{display:block;font-size:28px;color:var(--brand)}.stat span{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted)}.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:22px}.cta{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:34px;text-align:center}.stars{color:#e8a33d}footer.site{background:#12211f;color:#cfdcd8;padding:44px 0 26px;font-size:14.5px}footer.site h4{color:#fff;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 12px}.fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:26px}.fgrid ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:8px}.fbot{border-top:1px solid #243935;margin-top:28px;padding-top:16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#9fb3ae;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:960px){h1{font-size:29px}.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}nav.main{display:none;width:100%;padding:8px 0 12px}nav.main.on{display:grid}.burger{display:block;order:-1}.hrow{flex-wrap:wrap}.phone{display:none}}</style></head><body><div class='promo' id='promo'>🚚 <b>FREE shipping on orders $75+</b> &nbsp;•&nbsp; 10% off your first order with code <b>WELCOME10</b> <button onclick=\\\"document.getElementById('promo').remove()\\\">×</button></div><header class='site'><div class='wrap hrow'><button class='burger' onclick=\\\"document.querySelector('nav.main').classList.toggle('on')\\\">☰</button><a class='logo' href='/index.html'>Yoga<i>Direct</i></a><nav class='main'><a href='/shop.html'>Shop All</a><a href='/shop.html#mats'>Mats</a><a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Props</a><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio &amp; Bulk</a><a href='/about.html'>About</a><a href='/faq.html'>Help</a></nav><div class='hact'><div class='phone'>1-800-916-4642<small>Mon–Fri 9–5 PT</small></div><a class='icbtn' href='/cart.html'>Cart</a></div></div></header><section class='hero'><div class='wrap narrow'><h1>From our team of yoga lovers to you</h1><p style='font-size:18px;color:var(--muted)'>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p><a class='btn btn-p' href='/shop.html'>Shop Best Sellers</a> <a class='btn btn-o' href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk Pricing for Studios</a></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><div class='stats'><div class='stat'><b>1999</b><span>Serving yogis since</span></div><div class='stat'><b>6,000+</b><span>Studios supplied</span></div><div class='stat'><b>1M+</b><span>Orders shipped</span></div><div class='stat'><b>4.8/5</b><span>From 12,400+ reviews</span></div></div></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><h2 style='text-align:center'>What manufacturer-direct means for you</h2><div class='grid3' style='margin-top:22px'><div class='card'><b>No middleman markup</b><p style='margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)'>We make and source our own core line, so you pay factory-level prices whether you order one mat or a hundred.</p></div><div class='card'><b>Consistent quality</b><p style='margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)'>The same specs and colors on every reorder — important when your studio racks need to match.</p></div><div class='card'><b>Real people, real support</b><p style='margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)'>Call us and a human who knows yoga gear answers. Bulk buyers get a dedicated rep.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap narrow'><h2>Our promise</h2><p><b>60-day returns.</b> If a product is not right, send it back unused within 60 days for a full refund.</p><p><b>Ships in 1 business day.</b> In-stock orders leave our US warehouse fast, with free ground shipping over $75.</p><p><b>Fair pricing, always.</b> Volume discounts start at just 6 units and teachers receive a standing 10% off.</p><p><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span> “Their rep handled freight for 120 mats and everything arrived early.” — Karen S., event planner</p></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><div class='cta'><h2 style='margin-bottom:6px'>Ready to gear up?</h2><p style='opacity:.92'>Shop the same mats and props that outfit 6,000+ studios — or get a bulk quote today.</p><a class='btn btn-p' href='/shop.html'>Shop Now</a> <a class='btn' style='background:#fff;color:var(--ink)' href='/wholesale.html'>Get a Bulk Quote</a></div></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<i style='color:#7fd2bd'>Direct</i></div><p style='max-width:320px'>Manufacturer-direct yoga mats and props since 1999. Call <b style='color:#fff'>1-800-916-4642</b>.</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/shop.html#mats'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Straps</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#restore'>Bolsters &amp; Blankets</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#bundles'>Bundles</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Business</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Wholesale &amp; Bulk</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html#teacher'>Teacher Discount</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/faq.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a></li><li><a href='/faq.html'>FAQ</a></li><li><a href='/cart.html'>View Cart</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'><span>© 2024 YogaDirect.</span><span>support@yogadirect.com</span></div></div></footer></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/faq.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Shipping, Returns & FAQ | YogaDirect</title><meta name='description' content='Shipping times, free shipping thresholds, 60-day returns, bulk discounts and product care. Everything you need to know before ordering from YogaDirect.'><style>:root{--ink:#17262b;--muted:#5c6b70;--brand:#0f6e5c;--dark:#0a4f42;--accent:#e2703a;--sand:#f8f5f0;--line:#e7e2d9}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}h1{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.9px;margin:0 0 10px}h2{font-size:24px;margin:26px 0 12px}p{margin:0 0 14px}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.narrow{max-width:820px}.promo{background:var(--dark);color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;text-align:center;padding:9px 34px;position:relative}.promo b{color:#ffd68a}.promo button{position:absolute;right:10px;top:4px;background:none;border:0;color:#fff;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer}header.site{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.hrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:12px 0}.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:22px}.logo i{color:var(--brand);font-style:normal}nav.main{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;flex-wrap:wrap}.hact{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}.phone{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand);text-align:right;line-height:1.25}.phone small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}.icbtn{background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;padding:6px;font:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:15px}.burger{display:none;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 11px;cursor:pointer}.btn{display:inline-block;border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:14px 24px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;text-align:center}.btn-p{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(226,112,58,.28)}.btn-o{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--ink)}.hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--sand),#fff);padding:38px 0}.acc{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:10px;background:#fff}.acc summary{padding:16px 18px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.acc div{padding:0 18px 16px;color:var(--muted)}.sec{padding:40px 0}.sec.alt{background:var(--sand)}.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:20px}.link{font-weight:800;color:var(--brand);border-bottom:2px solid var(--brand)}.cta{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:30px;text-align:center}footer.site{background:#12211f;color:#cfdcd8;padding:44px 0 26px;font-size:14.5px}footer.site h4{color:#fff;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 12px}.fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:26px}.fgrid ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:8px}.fbot{border-top:1px solid #243935;margin-top:28px;padding-top:16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#9fb3ae;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:960px){h1{font-size:28px}.grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}nav.main{display:none;width:100%;padding:8px 0 12px}nav.main.on{display:grid}.burger{display:block;order:-1}.hrow{flex-wrap:wrap}.phone{display:none}}</style></head><body><div class='promo' id='promo'>🚚 <b>FREE shipping on orders $75+</b> &nbsp;•&nbsp; 60-day returns on everything <button onclick=\\\"document.getElementById('promo').remove()\\\">×</button></div><header class='site'><div class='wrap hrow'><button class='burger' onclick=\\\"document.querySelector('nav.main').classList.toggle('on')\\\">☰</button><a class='logo' href='/index.html'>Yoga<i>Direct</i></a><nav class='main'><a href='/shop.html'>Shop All</a><a href='/shop.html#mats'>Mats</a><a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Props</a><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio &amp; Bulk</a><a href='/about.html'>About</a><a href='/faq.html'>Help</a></nav><div class='hact'><div class='phone'>1-800-916-4642<small>Mon–Fri 9–5 PT</small></div><a class='icbtn' href='/cart.html'>Cart</a></div></div></header><section class='hero'><div class='wrap narrow'><h1>Shipping, returns &amp; answers</h1><p style='color:var(--muted);font-size:17px'>Everything you need to know before you order. Still stuck? Call <b>1-800-916-4642</b> or email support@yogadirect.com — a real person answers Monday–Friday, 9–5 PT.</p></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap narrow'><h2 style='margin-top:0'>Shipping</h2><details class='acc' open><summary>How fast do orders ship?</summary><div>In-stock orders placed before 1pm PT ship the same business day; everything else ships the next business day from our US warehouse. Typical delivery is 2–5 business days.</div></details><details class='acc'><summary>What does shipping cost?</summary><div>Free ground shipping on orders over $75 within the contiguous US. Below that, a flat $6.95. Expedited and freight rates are quoted at cost at checkout.</div></details><details class='acc'><summary>Do you ship large or bulk orders by freight?</summary><div>Yes. Orders of 20+ mats usually travel LTL or pallet freight. Your rep quotes it at cost and schedules the delivery window. <a class='link' href='/wholesale.html'>Request a bulk quote</a>.</div></details><details class='acc'><summary>Do you ship to Alaska, Hawaii or Canada?</summary><div>Yes — rates are calculated at checkout. For international and Canadian bulk orders, email support@yogadirect.com for a freight quote.</div></details><h2>Returns &amp; guarantee</h2><details class='acc'><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><div>Return any unused item within 60 days of delivery for a full refund of the product price. Start a return by emailing support@yogadirect.com with your order number — we send a label and instructions.</div></details><details class='acc'><summary>What if something arrives damaged or defective?</summary><div>Send us a photo within 30 days and we ship a replacement immediately at no cost. Products that fail in normal use are replaced under our guarantee.</div></details><details class='acc'><summary>Can I exchange for a different color or thickness?</summary><div>Absolutely. Exchanges on unused items are free within 60 days; we simply ship the replacement when the return scans.</div></details><h2>Products &amp; pricing</h2><details class='acc'><summary>Which mat thickness should I choose?</summary><div>1/8\\\" is light and portable and preferred by many studios for stacking. 1/4\\\" is our best seller and the best balance of cushioning and stability. 1/2\\\" is ideal for sensitive knees, restorative and therapy work.</div></details><details class='acc'><summary>How do I clean my mat?</summary><div>Wipe with mild soap and water or a diluted vinegar solution, then air dry flat. Avoid machine washing and direct sun.</div></details><details class='acc'><summary>Do you offer discounts for studios, teachers or schools?</summary><div>Yes. Volume discounts begin at 6 units and increase at 12, 24 and 50+. Certified teachers get a standing 10% off, and schools and nonprofits can order on Net-30 terms. <a class='link' href='/wholesale.html'>See wholesale pricing</a>.</div></details><details class='acc'><summary>Can I get a sample before a large order?</summary><div>Yes — we include a free sample mat on quoted orders of 20+ units so you can confirm feel, grip and color before committing.</div></details><h2>Orders &amp; payment</h2><details class='acc'><summary>What payment methods do you accept?</summary><div>All major credit cards, PayPal and Shop Pay. Approved businesses, studios and institutions can pay by purchase order on Net-30 terms.</div></details><details class='acc'><summary>Is checkout secure?</summary><div>Yes. Every page is served over SSL and payment data is processed by PCI-compliant providers. We never store card numbers.</div></details><details class='acc'><summary>Can I change or cancel my order?</summary><div>Call us within two hours of ordering and we will do our best to catch it before it leaves the warehouse.</div></details></div></section><section class='sec alt'><div class='wrap'><div class='grid3'><div class='card'><b>Call us</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)'>1-800-916-4642<br>Mon–Fri, 9–5 PT</p></div><div class='card'><b>Email us</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)'>support@yogadirect.com<br>Replies within 1 business day</p></div><div class='card'><b>Bulk &amp; wholesale</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)'>wholesale@yogadirect.com<br><a class='link' href='/wholesale.html'>Request a quote</a></p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap narrow'><div class='cta'><h2 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Ready when you are</h2><p style='opacity:.92'>Free shipping over $75, 60-day returns, and 25 years of yoga gear behind every order.</p><a class='btn btn-p' href='/shop.html'>Shop Best Sellers</a> <a class='btn' style='background:#fff;color:var(--ink)' href='/wholesale.html'>Get Bulk Pricing</a></div></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<i style='color:#7fd2bd'>Direct</i></div><p style='max-width:320px'>Manufacturer-direct yoga mats and props since 1999.</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/shop.html#mats'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Straps</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#bundles'>Bundles</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Business</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Wholesale &amp; Bulk</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html#teacher'>Teacher Discount</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/faq.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a></li><li><a href='/about.html'>About Us</a></li><li><a href='/cart.html'>View Cart</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'><span>© 2024 YogaDirect.</span><span>support@yogadirect.com</span></div></div></footer></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/cart.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><