x='0 0 100 100'><rect x='12' y='38' width='76' height='24' rx='12' fill='none' stroke='#3f6b5c' stroke-width='7'/></svg></div><div class='stars'>★★★★☆ <small>(488)</small></div><div class='pname'>Supportive Cotton Yoga Bolster</div></a><div class='price'>$44.95<span class='was'>$59.00</span></div><div class='save'>Save 24%</div><div class='mt'><button class='btn btn-p btn-full btn-sm' style='margin-top:12px' onclick='addCart(1)'>Add to cart</button></div></div></div></div></section><section class='section'><div class='wrap band' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:34px;align-items:center'><div><div class='eyebrow' style='color:#ffd9a8'>Studios, gyms, schools &amp; events</div><h2>Outfit your whole studio and save up to 40%</h2><p>Tell us what you need and a real person will send you a custom quote — usually the same business day. Freight-friendly pallet pricing, custom logo options and net terms available for qualified accounts.</p><div class='cta-row' style='margin-bottom:0'><a class='btn btn-p' href='/wholesale'>Request my bulk quote</a><a class='btn' style='background:transparent;color:#fff;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5)' href='/contact'>Ask a question</a></div></div><div class='card' style='padding:22px'><h3 style='margin-bottom:8px'>Volume pricing at a glance</h3><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px'><tr style='border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)'><td style='padding:9px 0'>1–4 mats</td><td align='right'><b>$39.95 ea</b></td></tr><tr style='border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)'><td style='padding:9px 0'>5–9 mats</td><td align='right'><b>$35.95 ea</b> <span class='save'>-10%</span></td></tr><tr style='border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)'><td style='padding:9px 0'>10–24 mats</td><td align='right'><b>$31.96 ea</b> <span class='save'>-20%</span></td></tr><tr><td style='padding:9px 0'>25+ mats</td><td align='right'><b>$27.97 ea</b> <span class='save'>-30%</span></td></tr></table><p class='muted' style='font-size:13px;margin:12px 0 0'>Larger orders and mixed pallets qualify for deeper discounts.</p></div></div></section><section class='section alt'><div class='wrap'><h2 class='center'>Why practitioners buy direct from us</h2><div class='grid g4' style='margin-top:26px'><div class='card'><h3>Made &amp; sourced by us</h3><p class='muted' style='margin:0'>We manufacture and source our own goods, so you get high-quality gear at prices retailers can&rsquo;t match.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Fast, honest shipping</h3><p class='muted' style='margin:0'>Orders ship from our warehouse in about 1 business day. Free over $75, flat-rate under.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>60-day happiness promise</h3><p class='muted' style='margin:0'>Practice on it. If it isn&rsquo;t right, send it back within 60 days for a refund or exchange.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Real humans, real advice</h3><p class='muted' style='margin:0'>Our team practices yoga. Call or email and we&rsquo;ll help you pick the right thickness, size and quantity.</p></div></div><p class='center muted' style='max-width:78ch;margin:30px auto 0'>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the yoga community as a whole. From our team of yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p></div></section><section class='section'><div class='wrap'><h2 class='center'>4.8 out of 5 from 3,200+ reviews</h2><div class='grid g3' style='margin-top:24px'><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>&ldquo;We replaced all 24 studio mats and paid less than half of what our old supplier charged. Grip is excellent even in a heated room.&rdquo;</p><p class='muted' style='margin:0;font-size:14px'><b>Marisa T.</b> — Studio owner, Austin TX</p></div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>&ldquo;Ordered Friday, practicing on it Monday. The 6mm mat is genuinely cushioned for my knees and the price felt like a mistake.&rdquo;</p><p class='muted' style='margin:0;font-size:14px'><b>Devon P.</b> — Home practitioner</p></div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>&ldquo;I run teacher trainings and order blocks and straps in bulk every year. Same-day quotes and the props hold up to constant use.&rdquo;</p><p class='muted' style='margin:0;font-size:14px'><b>Aisha R.</b> — YTT lead, Portland OR</p></div></div></div></section><section class='section alt'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:760px'><h2 class='center'>Questions before you order?</h2><div style='margin-top:22px'><details open><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p class='muted' style='margin:10px 0 0'>In-stock orders leave our warehouse in about 1 business day. Most U.S. deliveries arrive in 2–5 business days, and you&rsquo;ll get tracking by email.</p></details><details><summary>Is shipping really free?</summary><p class='muted' style='margin:10px 0 0'>Yes — free standard shipping on U.S. orders over $75. Bulk and pallet orders are quoted with discounted freight.</p></details><details><summary>What if the mat isn&rsquo;t right for me?</summary><p class='muted' style='margin:10px 0 0'>You have 60 days. Contact us for a return label and choose a refund or an exchange for a different thickness or color.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer discounts for studios and teachers?</summary><p class='muted' style='margin:10px 0 0'>Absolutely. Volume discounts start at 5 units and reach 40% on larger orders. <a href='/wholesale' style='color:var(--sun);font-weight:700'>Request a quote</a> and we&rsquo;ll respond the same business day.</p></details></div><div class='center' style='margin-top:26px'><a class='btn btn-p' href='/shop'>Start shopping</a></di