full' href='/yoga-mats.html'>Shop Now</a></div></div><div class='pcard'><div class='ph'>🧱</div><div class='bd'><span class='tag'>Bundle</span><a href='/props.html'><strong>Foam Yoga Block 2-Pack</strong></a><div class='tiny'><span class='stars'>★★★★☆</span> (2,011)</div><div class='price'>$17.95<span class='was'>$21.95</span></div><div class='tiny'>Bulk cases of 20 available</div><a class='btn sm full' href='/props.html'>Shop Now</a></div></div><div class='pcard'><div class='ph'>📦</div><div class='bd'><span class='tag'>Save 25%</span><a href='/wholesale.html'><strong>Studio Starter Pack (10 mats + props)</strong></a><div class='tiny'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span> (168)</div><div class='price'>$319.00<span class='was'>$425.00</span></div><div class='tiny'>Everything for a 10-person class</div><a class='btn sm full' href='/wholesale.html'>Get Bulk Price</a></div></div></div><p style='text-align:center;margin-top:28px'><a class='btn alt' href='/shop-all.html'>Browse all products →</a></p></div></section><section class='band'><div class='wrap'><div class='grid g2' style='align-items:center'><div><h2>Bulk pricing that grows your studio, not our margin</h2><p>Discounts start at 10 units on almost every item, and they stack across your whole order — mats, blocks, straps and bolsters all count toward your tier.</p><table class='tiers'><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Your discount</th><th>Best for</th></tr><tr><td>10–24 units</td><td>10% off</td><td>Small studios &amp; teachers</td></tr><tr><td>25–49 units</td><td>15% off</td><td>Studios &amp; schools</td></tr><tr><td>50–99 units</td><td>20% off</td><td>Gyms &amp; universities</td></tr><tr><td>100+ units</td><td>25%+ &amp; custom freight</td><td>Events, resorts, chains</td></tr></table><p class='tiny' style='color:#cfdcd3'>Purchase orders, W-9s, tax-exempt and net-30 terms welcome for schools, gyms and government buyers.</p></div><div class='quote'><h3>Request your bulk quote</h3><p class='tiny'>Average response time: under 1 business hour.</p><form data-js data-msg='Got it! A bulk specialist is preparing your pricing and freight estimate and will email you within one business hour.'><div class='f2'><div><label for='b-name'>Name</label><input id='b-name' required></div><div><label for='b-org'>Studio / organization</label><input id='b-org'></div></div><div class='f2'><div><label for='b-email'>Email</label><input id='b-email' type='email' required></div><div><label for='b-qty'>Approx. quantity</label><input id='b-qty' placeholder='e.g. 40 mats, 20 blocks'></div></div><label for='b-notes'>Anything else? (colors, deadline, budget)</label><textarea id='b-notes' rows='3'></textarea><button class='btn full' style='margin-top:16px'>Send My Request</button></form></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><h2 class='sec'>Why 10,000+ studios buy direct from us</h2><div class='grid g3'><div class='card'><h3>🏭 We make it, so you save</h3><p>We manufacture and source our own goods. That is how we consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices — year after year, order after order.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>📅 25+ years of reliability</h3><p>Faithfully supplying the yoga community since 1999. Consistent specs, consistent colors, consistent restocks — so your studio looks the same next season.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>🤝 Real humans on your order</h3><p>Talk to a specialist who knows the difference between a therapeutic bolster and a restorative one. Quotes, samples and freight sorted in hours, not days.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='quiet'><div class='wrap'><h2 class='sec'>What our customers say</h2><div class='grid g3'><div class='card'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>“We replaced all 42 studio mats for less than the two brands we were quoted elsewhere, and they have survived two years of heated classes.”</p><p class='tiny'><strong>Marisa L.</strong> · Studio owner, Austin TX</p></div><div class='card'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>“Ordered 120 mats for a corporate wellness event on a tight deadline. Quote in an hour, delivered in four days. Flawless.”</p><p class='tiny'><strong>Devon R.</strong> · Corporate wellness planner</p></div><div class='card'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>“I have bought my own mats and blocks here since 2011. Same quality, still the best price I can find anywhere.”</p><p class='tiny'><strong>Anita P.</strong> · Certified yoga teacher</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><div class='card' style='text-align:center;background:#f4f1ea'><h2 class='sec' style='margin-bottom:8px'>Our promise: practice on it for 30 days</h2><p class='sub'>If your mat or prop is not right for your body or your studio, send it back within 30 days for a refund or exchange. Damaged in transit? We replace it, no photos-and-forms runaround.</p><a class='btn' href='/shop-all.html'>Start Shopping</a> <a class='btn ghost' href='/help.html'>Read our return policy</a></div></div></section><div class='news'><div class='in'><div><h2 style='margin-bottom:6px'>Get 10% off your first order</h2><p class='tiny'>Join 40,000 teachers and studio owners for restock alerts, bulk deals and practice tips. One email a week, unsubscribe anytime.</p></div><form data-js data-msg='Welcome! Check your inbox — your 10% off code is on its way.'><input type='email' required placeholder='you@email.com' aria-label='Email address'><button class='btn'>Send My 10% Code</button></form></div></div><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></div><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have faithfully supplied the yoga community since 1999.</p><p><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a><br>Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm ET</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/yoga-mats.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Blocks &amp; Wedges</a></li><