}.g3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.g2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.f2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><div class='topbar'><div class='in'><div>🚚 <b>Free shipping on orders over $99</b> · Freight quoted same day on pallets</div><div>Supplying the yoga community since 1999 · <a href='/contact.html'>Talk to a bulk specialist →</a></div></div></div><header class='site'><div class='hrow'><a class='logo' href='/index.html'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></a><form class='search' action='/shop-all.html'><input placeholder='Search mats, blocks, straps, bolsters…' aria-label='Search products'><button>Search</button></form><div class='hlinks'><a href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk Quote</a><a href='/help.html'>Help</a><a href='#cart'>Cart (0)</a></div></div><nav class='main'><ul><li><a href='/index.html'>Home</a></li><li><a href='/shop-all.html'>Shop All</a></li><li><a href='/yoga-mats.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Props &amp; Accessories</a></li><li><a class='active' href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk &amp; Wholesale</a></li><li><a href='/about.html'>About Us</a></li><li><a href='/help.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html'>Contact</a></li></ul></nav></header><div class='hero'><div class='in'><div><div class='crumbs'><a href='/index.html'>Home</a> / Bulk &amp; Wholesale</div><span class='eyebrow'>Trusted by 10,000+ studios, schools &amp; gyms</span><h1>Outfit your studio for less — direct from the people who make the gear</h1><p class='lead'>We manufacture and source our own mats and props, so there is no distributor markup between you and your class. Tell us your class size and we will send itemized pricing, freight and lead time — usually within one business hour.</p><ul class='ticks'><li><strong>Discounts from just 10 units</strong> — and they stack across mats and props in one order</li><li><strong>Purchase orders, W-9s, tax-exempt and net-30 terms</strong> for schools, gyms and government buyers</li><li><strong>Free color mixing</strong> and consistent restocks season after season</li><li><strong>Samples available</strong> before you commit to a large order</li><li><strong>Deadline-driven events welcome</strong> — retreats, festivals, corporate wellness, teacher trainings</li></ul><div class='card' style='background:#fff'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p style='margin:6px 0'>“Ordered 120 mats for a corporate wellness event on a tight deadline. Quote in an hour, delivered in four days. Flawless.”</p><p class='tiny'><strong>Devon R.</strong> · Corporate wellness planner</p></div></div><div class='quote' id='quote'><h2 style='font-size:24px'>Get your bulk quote</h2><p class='tiny'>Free, no obligation. Average response: under 1 business hour, Mon–Fri.</p><form data-js data-msg='Thank you — your request is in. A bulk specialist will email itemized pricing, freight and lead time within one business hour (Mon–Fri).'><div class='f2'><div><label for='w-name'>Your name*</label><input id='w-name' required></div><div><label for='w-org'>Studio / organization</label><input id='w-org'></div></div><div class='f2'><div><label for='w-email'>Email*</label><input id='w-email' type='email' required></div><div><label for='w-phone'>Phone (optional)</label><input id='w-phone'></div></div><div class='f2'><div><label for='w-type'>Buyer type</label><select id='w-type'><option>Yoga / pilates studio</option><option>Gym or fitness center</option><option>School / university</option><option>Corporate wellness</option><option>Event, retreat or festival</option><option>Reseller / retailer</option><option>Individual teacher</option></select></div><div><label for='w-when'>When do you need it?</label><select id='w-when'><option>ASAP (this week)</option><option>Within 2–4 weeks</option><option>1–3 months</option><option>Just budgeting for now</option></select></div></div><label for='w-items'>What do you need? (quantities and items)*</label><textarea id='w-items' rows='4' required placeholder='e.g. 40 x 1/4-inch mats (mixed colors), 60 foam blocks, 30 straps, 15 bolsters'></textarea><label for='w-zip'>Delivery ZIP (for freight estimate)</label><input id='w-zip'><label><input type='checkbox' style='width:auto;margin-right:8px'>Send me a free sample before I order</label><button class='btn full' style='margin-top:16px'>Get My Bulk Price →</button><p class='tiny' style='margin:10px 0 0'>🔒 We use your details only to prepare your quote. No spam, ever.</p></form></div></div></div><section><div class='wrap'><h2 class='sec'>Volume pricing at a glance</h2><p class='sub'>Discounts apply per order, not per item — so a mixed order of mats, blocks and straps still qualifies.</p><table class='tiers'><tr><th>Units in your order</th><th>Discount off list</th><th>Typical buyer</th><th>Extras included</th></tr><tr><td>10–24</td><td>10%</td><td>Teachers, small studios</td><td>Free color mixing</td></tr><tr><td>25–49</td><td>15%</td><td>Studios, schools</td><td>Free color mixing, free sample</td></tr><tr><td>50–99</td><td>20%</td><td>Gyms, universities</td><td>Dedicated rep, PO terms</td></tr><tr><td>100+</td><td>25%+ (custom)</td><td>Events, resorts, chains</td><td>Custom freight, staged delivery</td></tr></table><p class='tiny' style='margin-top:12px'>Ask about private-label and logo printing on mats for events and franchises.</p></div></section><section class='quiet'><div class='wrap'><h2 class='sec'>Popular studio packages</h2><p class='sub'>Prebuilt bundles for common class sizes — or we will build one to match your schedule.</p><div class='grid g3'><div class='card'><h3>10-Student Starter</h3><p class='tiny'>10 mats · 20 blocks · 10 straps</p><p style='font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#24523f;margin:6px 0'>$319 <span class='tiny' style='font-weight:400'>(was $425)</span></p><a class='btn full' href='#quote'>Get This Package</a></div><div class='card'><h3>25-Student Studio</h3><p class='tiny'>25 mats · 50 blocks · 25 straps · 10 blankets</p><p style='font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#24523f;margin:6px 0'>$789 <span class='tiny' style='font-weight:400'>(was $1,040)</span></p><a class='btn full' href='#quote'>Get This Package</a></div><div class='card'><h3>Restorative Add-On</h3><p class='tiny'>10 bolsters · 20 blankets · 10 eye pillows</p><p style='font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#24523f;margin:6px 0'>$589 <span class='tiny' style='font-weight:400'>(was $749)</span></p><a class='btn full' href='#quote'>Get This Package</a></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><h2 class='sec'>How bulk ordering works</h2><div class='grid g4 steps'><div class='card'><h3>Send your list</h3><p class='tiny'>Rough quantities are fine — we will refine them with you.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Get pricing in ~1 hour</h3><p class='tiny'>Itemized quote with freight and lead time, no obligation.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Approve or sample</h3><p class='tiny'>Pay by card, PO or net-30 terms. Request samples first if you like.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Ship &amp; restock</h3><p class='tiny'>Most orders ship in 1–3 business days. Your rep keeps your specs on file for easy reorders.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='band'><div class='wrap' style='text-align:center'><h2>Every week you wait, you are paying retail</h2><p>Get a free, itemized bulk quote today — most customers save 15–25% versus their current supplier.</p><a class='btn' href='#quote'>Request My Quote</a> <a class='btn ghost' href='/contact.html'>Email a specialist</a></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></div><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have faithfully supplied the yoga community since 1999.</p><p><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a><br>Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm ET</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/yoga-mats.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Blocks &amp; Wedges</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Straps &amp; Slings</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Bolsters &amp; Blankets</a></li><li><a href='/shop-all.html'>Sale &amp; Clearance</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Bulk buyers</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk &amp; Wholesale Pricing</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Request a Quote</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio Starter Packs</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Schools &amp; PO Orders</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html'>Request a Sample</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/help.html'>Shipping Info</a></li><li><a href='/help.html'>Returns &amp; Exchanges</a></li><li><a href='/help.html'>Mat Buying Guide</a></li><li><a href='/about.html'>About Us</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html'>Contact Us</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='copy'><div>© 2024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</div><div>Free shipping over $99 · 30-day returns · Secure checkout</div></div></div></footer><script>document.addEventListener('submit',function(e){var f=e.target;if(f.hasAttribute('data-js')){e.preventDefault();var d=document.createElement('div');d.className='ok';d.textContent=f.getAttribute('data-msg')||'Thank you — we will be in touch shortly.';f.parentNode.replaceChild(d,f);}});</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/about.html\",\"html\":\"<!doctype html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>About YogaDirect — Supplying the Yoga Community Since 1999</title><meta name='description' content='YogaDirect has supplied yoga mats and props since 1999. We manufacture and source our own goods so studios and practitioners get high-quality gear at amazing prices.'><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#22302a;background:#fff;line-height:1.55}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}h1,h2,h3{