#fff}.stat{text-align:center}.stat b{display:block;font-size:34px;color:#24523f;line-height:1.1}.stars{color:#e0a13f;font-weight:700}.crumbs{font-size:13px;color:#6b7a71;padding:14px 0}.news{background:#f4f1ea;border-top:1px solid #e6e1d8}.news .in{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px;align-items:center}.news form{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.news input{flex:1;min-width:220px;padding:11px 12px;border:1px solid #d8d2c7;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px}footer.site{background:#1e3c2f;color:#cfdcd3;font-size:14px;padding:44px 0 24px}footer.site h4{color:#fff;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 10px}footer.site ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}footer.site li{margin-bottom:7px}footer.site a:hover{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline}.fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:26px}.copy{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);margin-top:28px;padding-top:16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px}.ok{background:#e8f4ec;border:1px solid #2f6b52;color:#24523f;padding:14px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:12px;font-weight:600}@media(max-width:900px){.g4{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.g3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.g2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.news .in{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><div class='topbar'><div class='in'><div>🚚 <b>Free shipping on orders over $99</b> · Orders ship in 1 business day</div><div>Supplying the yoga community since 1999 · <a href='/wholesale.html'>Get a bulk quote →</a></div></div></div><header class='site'><div class='hrow'><a class='logo' href='/index.html'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></a><form class='search' action='/shop-all.html'><input placeholder='Search mats, blocks, straps, bolsters…' aria-label='Search products'><button>Search</button></form><div class='hlinks'><a href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk Quote</a><a href='/help.html'>Help</a><a href='#cart'>Cart (0)</a></div></div><nav class='main'><ul><li><a href='/index.html'>Home</a></li><li><a href='/shop-all.html'>Shop All</a></li><li><a href='/yoga-mats.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Props &amp; Accessories</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk &amp; Wholesale</a></li><li><a class='active' href='/about.html'>About Us</a></li><li><a href='/help.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html'>Contact</a></li></ul></nav></header><div class='wrap'><div class='crumbs'><a href='/index.html'>Home</a> / About Us</div><h1>From our team of yoga lovers to you</h1><p class='lead'>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the yoga community since 1999, and we are confident we can help you grow your studio, event or personal practice with everything you need and more.</p><p class='lead'>We manufacture and source our own goods, which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice, but the yoga community as a whole. Thank you.</p></div><section><div class='wrap'><div class='grid g4'><div class='card stat'><b>1999</b><span class='tiny'>Serving the yoga community since</span></div><div class='card stat'><b>10,000+</b><span class='tiny'>Studios, schools &amp; gyms supplied</span></div><div class='card stat'><b>4.8/5</b><span class='tiny'>Average rating, 6,400+ reviews</span></div><div class='card stat'><b>1 day</b><span class='tiny'>Typical order handling time</span></div></div></div></section><section class='quiet'><div class='wrap'><h2 class='sec'>What makes us different</h2><div class='grid g3'><div class='card'><h3>🏭 We are the source</h3><p>Because we manufacture and source our own goods, there is no distributor markup. That is why the same mat costs a studio 30–50% less here than through a reseller.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>📐 Consistency you can plan around</h3><p>Same specs, same colors, same sizes year after year. When you add ten mats to a studio floor in 2026, they still match the ones you bought in 2019.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>🧘 Run by people who practice</h3><p>Our team teaches, practices and tests. Ask us about mat thickness for sensitive knees or bolster firmness for restorative work — you will get a real answer.</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><h2 class='sec'>Who we supply</h2><div class='grid g4'><div class='card'><h3>Yoga &amp; pilates studios</h3><p class='tiny'>Full floors of mats, blocks, straps and bolsters, with easy reorders on file.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Schools &amp; universities</h3><p class='tiny'>POs, W-9s, tax-exempt paperwork and net-30 terms welcome.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Gyms &amp; wellness centers</h3><p class='tiny'>Heavy-use mats and props built for daily class rotation.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Events &amp; retreats</h3><p class='tiny'>Large-quantity, deadline-driven orders with staged delivery and freight options.</p></div></div><p style='margin-top:26px'><a class='btn' href='/wholesale.html'>Get a bulk quote</a> <a class='btn ghost' href='/shop-all.html'>Shop the full range</a></p></div></section><section class='quiet'><div class='wrap'><h2 class='sec'>Our promise to you</h2><div class='grid g3'><div class='card'><h3>30-day practice guarantee</h3><p class='tiny'>Use it, unroll it, take it to class. If it is not right, return or exchange it within 30 days.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Honest pricing</h3><p class='tiny'>No inflated list prices and fake countdowns. Direct prices, with volume discounts published openly.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Real support</h3><p class='tiny'>Email a specialist and get a human reply the same business day, Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm ET.</p></div></div></div></section><div class='news'><div class='in'><div><h2 style='margin-bottom:6px'>Get 10% off your first order</h2><p class='tiny'>Join 40,000 teachers and studio owners. One email a week, unsubscribe anytime.</p></div><form data-js data-msg='Welcome! Check your inbox — your 10% off code is on its way.'><input type='email' required placeholder='you@email.com' aria-label='Email address'><button class='btn'>Send My 10% Code</button></form></div></div><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></div><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have faithfully supplied the yoga community since 1999.</p><p><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a><br>Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm ET</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/yoga-mats.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Blocks &amp; Wedges</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Straps &amp; Slings</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Bolsters &amp; Blankets</a></li><li><a href='/shop-all.html'>Sale &amp; Clearance</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Bulk buyers</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk &amp; Wholesale Pricing</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Request a Quote</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio Starter Packs</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Schools &amp; PO Orders</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html'>Request a Sample</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/help.html'>Shipping Info</a></li><li><a href='/help.html'>Returns &amp; Exchanges</a></li><li><a href='/help.html'>Mat Buying Guide</a></li><li><a href='/about.html'>About Us</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html'>Contact Us</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='copy'><div>© 2024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</div><div>Free shipping over $99 · 30-day returns · Secure checkout</div></div></div></footer><script>document.addEventListener('submit',function(e){var f=e.target;if(f.hasAttribute('data-js')){e.preventDefault();var d=document.createElement('div');d.className='ok';d.textContent=f.getAttribute('data-msg')||'Thank you — we will be in touch shortly.';f.parentNode.replaceChild(d,f);}});</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/help.html\",\"html\":\"<!doctype html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Shipping, Returns &amp; Buying Guide | YogaDirect Help Center</title><meta name='description' content='Shipping times, free shipping over $99, 30-day returns, bulk freight, PO and net-30 terms, plus a yoga mat buying guide. Everything you need before you order.'><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#22302a;background:#fff;line-height:1.55}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}h1,h2,h3{line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 12px}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.topbar{background:#24523f;color:#fff;font-size:13px}.topbar .in{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.topbar b{color:#ffd8a8}.topbar a{text-decoration:underline}header.site{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e1d8}.hrow{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:14px 20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:22px;color:#24523f;letter-spacing:-.5px}.logo span{color:#e07a3f}form.search{flex:1;display:flex;min-width:240px;max-width:440px}form.search input{flex:1;padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid #d8d2c7;border-right:0;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;font-size:14px}form.search button{border:0;background:#2f6b52;color:#fff;padding:0 16px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.hlinks{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}nav.main{border-top:1px solid #f1ede5;overflow-x:auto}nav.main ul{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:20px;list-style:none;padding:10px 20px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}nav.main a.active{color:#2f6b52;border-bottom:2px solid #e07a3f;padding-bottom:2px}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#e07a3f;color:#fff;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px}.btn:hover{background:#c8642c}.btn.alt{background:#2f6b52}.btn.ghost{background:#fff;color:#24523f;border:2px solid #24523f}section{padding:44px 0}h2.sec{font-size:28px}.grid{display:grid;gap:20px}.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.g2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.card{border:1px solid #e6e1d8;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;background:#fff}.tiny{font-size:13px;color:#6b7a71}.quiet{background:#f4f1ea}.band{background:#24523f;color:#fff}.band h2{color:#fff}table.t{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;background:#fff}table.t th,table.t td{border:1px solid #e6e1d8;padding:10px 12px;text-align:left}table.t th{background:#f4f1ea}details{border:1px solid #e6e1d8;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;background:#fff}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}details p{margin:10px 0 0}.crumbs{font-size:13px;color:#6b7a71;padding:14px 0}footer.site{background:#1e3c2f;color:#cfdcd3;font-size:14px;padding:44px 0 24px}footer.site h4{color:#fff;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 10px}footer.site ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}footer.site li{margin-bottom:7px}footer.site a:hover{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline}.fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:26px}.copy{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);margin-top:28px;padding-top:16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:900px){.g4{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.g3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.g2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}table.t{font-size:13px}}</style></head><body><div class='topbar'><div class='in'><div>🚚 <b>Free shipping on orders over $99</b> · Orders ship in 1 business day</div><div>Supplying the yoga community since 1999 · <a href='/wholesale.html'>Get a bulk quote →</a></div></div></div><header class='site'><div class='hrow'><a class='logo' href='/index.html'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></a><form class='search' action='/shop-all.html'><input placeholder='Search mats, blocks, straps, bolsters…' aria-label='Search products'><button>Search</button></form><div class='hlinks'><a href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk Quote</a><a href='/help.html'>Help</a><a href='#cart'>Cart (0)</a></div></div><nav class='main'><ul><li><a href='/index.html'>Home</a></li><li><a href='/shop-all.html'>Shop All</a></li><li><a href='/yoga-mats.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Props &amp; Accessories</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk &amp; Wholesale</a></li><li><a href='/about.html'>About Us</a></li><li><a class='active' href='/help.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html'>Contact</a></li></ul></nav></header><div class='wrap'><div class='crumbs'><a href='/index.html'>Home</a> / Help Center</div><h1>Shipping, returns &amp; buying guide</h1><p class='tiny'>Everything we would want to know before ordering. Cannot find it? <a href='/contact.html' style='color:#2f6b52;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline'>Ask us — we reply the same business day.</a></p></div><section><div class='wrap'><h2 class='sec'>Shipping</h2><table class='t'><tr><th>Order</th><th>Cost</th><th>Handling</th><th>Typical delivery</th></tr><tr><td>Under $99</td><td>Flat-rate ground, calculated at checkout</td><td>1 business day</td><td>2–6 business days</td></tr><tr><td>$99 and over</td><td><strong>Free ground shipping</strong></td><td>1 business day</td><td>2–6 business days</td></tr><tr><td>Expedited (2-day / overnight)</td><td>Quoted at checkout</td><td>Same day if ordered before 12pm ET</td><td>1–2 business days</td></tr><tr><td>Bulk / pallet freight (50+ mats)</td><td>Quoted same day by your rep</td><td>1–3 business days</td><td>3–8 business days</td></tr></table><p class='tiny' style='margin-top:12px'>We ship within the contiguous United States. Alaska, Hawaii and international orders are quoted individually — <a href='/contact.html' style='text-decoration:underline'>contact us</a> for a rate.</p></div></section><section class='quiet'><div class='wrap'><h2 class='sec'>Returns &amp; the 30-day practice guarantee</h2><div class='grid g3'><div class='card'><h3>Practice on it</h3><p class='tiny'>Unroll it and use it. If the thickness, grip or firmness is not right for your body, you can still return it.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>30 days to decide</h3><p class='tiny'>Contact us within 30 days of delivery for a return or exchange authorization. Refunds go back to your original payment method.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Damaged or wrong item?</h3><p class='tiny'>We replace it at our cost, with no photo-and-form runaround. Just tell us what arrived.</p></div></div><p class='tiny' style='margin-top:14px'>Bulk and custom-printed orders may have different terms — your rep will confirm in writing before you approve the quote.</p></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><h2 class='sec'>Mat buying guide</h2><div class='grid g2'><div><details open><summary>What thickness should I choose?</summary><p class='tiny'>1/4 inch (6mm) is the studio standard — cushion plus stability. Choose 1/2 inch (12mm) for sensitive knees or therapeutic work, and 2mm if you travel.</p></details><details><summary>What works best for hot yoga?</summary><p class='tiny'>A 5mm grip mat plus a non-slip mat towel. Closed-cell surfaces wipe clean and do not absorb sweat.</p></details><details><summary>How many props per student?</summary><p class='tiny'>Plan on 1 mat, 2 blocks and 1 strap per student. Add 1 bolster and 2 blankets per student for restorative classes.</p></details></div><div><details><summary>Do you offer samples before a bulk order?</summary><p class='tiny'>Yes. Request a sample in your <a href='/wholesale.html' style='text-decoration:underline'>bulk quote form</a> and we will send one before you commit.</p></details><details><summary>Can I pay with a purchase order or net-30?</summary><p class='tiny'>Yes — we work with schools, universities, gyms and government buyers. We supply W-9s and accept tax-exempt documentation.</p></details><details><summary>How do I clean and store mats?</summary><p class='tiny'>Wipe with mild soap and water, air dry flat away from direct sun, and store rolled loosely rather than folded. Rotate studio mats to even out wear.</p></details></div></div></div></section><section class='band'><div class='wrap' style='text-align:center'><h2>Still deciding? Talk to a human.</h2><p>Tell us your practice or your class size and we will tell you exactly what to order — no upselling.</p><a class='btn' href='/contact.html'>Ask a Specialist</a> <a class='btn ghost' href='/shop-all.html'>Shop All Products</a></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></div><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have faithfully supplied the yoga community since 1999.</p><p><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a><br>Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm ET</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/yoga-mats.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Blocks &amp; Wedges</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Straps &amp; Slings</a></li><li><a href='/props.html'>Bolsters &amp; Blankets</a></li><li><a href='/shop-all.html'>Sale &amp; Clearance</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Bulk buyers</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk &amp; Wholesale Pricing</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Request a Quote</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio Starter Packs</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Schools &amp; PO Orders</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html'>Request a Sample</a>