i studio-size form leading to a quote CTA for lead generation, followed by a four-item trust bar.\n\nBeyond that I'm mapping out the rest of the homepage: a six-category shop section, a four-product best sellers grid, a bulk pricing band with a tier table and quote form, three \"why us\" cards, three testimonials, and a guarantee plus newsletter signup. Then I'll move into writing out all the actual pages, keeping things thorough but reasonably concise, including the product page with root-relative links, reusing the same CSS block across roughly nine pages for consistency. Now I'm drafting the product card markup...\n\nStill writing product card markup...\n\nI also need to watch out for the quote mark in \"1/4\\\" Deluxe Sticky Yoga Mat\" breaking JSON escaping, so I'll switch to using the ¼ symbol or \"in.\" instead to keep things clean.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":2,"signature":""}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":5729,"completion_tokens":65797,"total_tokens":71526,"cost":1.67357,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":1.67357,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.028645,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":1.644925},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":7872,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0},"server_tool_use_details":{"web_search_requests":0}}}
