n. x 4 in.</p><button class='btn wide' data-add='blocks'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='ph'>➰</div><div class='body'><span class='stars'>★★★★☆ <span>(509)</span></span><a class='name' href='/shop'>8 ft Cotton Yoga Strap</a><div class='price'>$9.95</div><p class='mini' style='flex:1'>D-ring buckle, woven cotton, machine washable.</p><button class='btn wide' data-add='strap'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='ph'>🛏️</div><div class='body'><span class='stars'>★★★★★ <span>(311)</span></span><a class='name' href='/shop'>Rectangular Cotton Bolster</a><div class='price'>$44.95</div><p class='mini' style='flex:1'>Firm cotton batting with removable cover.</p><button class='btn wide' data-add='bolster'>Add to cart</button></div></div></div><p class='mini' style='margin-top:18px'>💡 Ordering 10 or more of any item? <a href='/wholesale'><b>Request a bulk quote</b></a> and we&rsquo;ll beat your current supplier where we can.</p></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><div class='band'><div><div class='eyebrow' style='color:#9dc3ab'>Wholesale &amp; bulk</div><h2>Outfitting a studio, school or event?</h2><p>Tell us what you need and get a same-day quote from a real person. Tiered pricing, custom logo mats, freight shipping and net terms available for qualified accounts.</p><a class='btn accent' href='/wholesale'>Request a bulk quote &rarr;</a></div><div><h3>Volume pricing</h3><div class='tier'><span>10&ndash;24 units</span><b>Save 15%</b></div><div class='tier'><span>25&ndash;49 units</span><b>Save 25%</b></div><div class='tier'><span>50+ units</span><b>Save up to 40%</b></div><p class='mini' style='color:#9dc3ab;margin-top:10px'>Mix and match across mats and props.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec sand'><div class='wrap'><h2 style='text-align:center'>Trusted by studios and home practitioners</h2><div class='grid g3' style='margin-top:24px'><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p>&ldquo;We replaced 40 mats for our studio and the price per mat was less than half of what we paid before. They&rsquo;ve held up beautifully through daily classes.&rdquo;</p><p class='who'>&mdash; Dana R., studio owner, Austin TX</p></div><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p>&ldquo;Ordered blocks, straps and blankets for a teacher training weekend. Everything arrived on time and the quality felt premium for the price.&rdquo;</p><p class='who'>&mdash; Marcus L., teacher trainer</p></div><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p>&ldquo;The 1/2 in. mat is a knee-saver. Simple ordering, fast shipping, and support actually answered my email the same day.&rdquo;</p><p class='who'>&mdash; Priya S., home practitioner</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><div class='grid g2' style='align-items:center;gap:40px'><div class='heroimg ph'>🌿</div><div><div class='eyebrow'>Our story</div><h2>Serving the yoga community since 1999</h2><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p><a class='btn ghost' href='/about'>More about us</a></div></div></div></section><section class='sec sand'><div class='wrap'><div class='grid g2' style='gap:34px;align-items:start'><div><h2>Questions before you order?</h2><details class='f'><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p class='mini'>In-stock orders placed before 1pm PT on business days ship the same day from our own warehouse. Most U.S. orders arrive in 2&ndash;5 business days.</p></details><details class='f'><summary>Do you offer discounts for studios and schools?</summary><p class='mini'>Yes. Volume discounts start at 10 units and reach up to 40% at 50+. <a href='/wholesale'>Request a bulk quote</a> and we&rsquo;ll price your list.</p></details><details class='f'><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p class='mini'>Unused items in original condition can be returned within 30 days. See <a href='/faq'>shipping &amp; returns</a> for details.</p></details><details class='f'><summary>Can you add my studio logo to mats?</summary><p class='mini'>We do custom-printed and custom-color mats for orders of 50+. Mention it in your quote request.</p></details><details class='f'><summary>Do you ship internationally or by freight?</summary><p class='mini'>Yes to both &mdash; contact us with your destination and quantity for a freight rate.</p></details></div><form class='box' data-thanks='Thanks! Your 10% code is WELCOME10 &mdash; it is also on its way to your inbox.'><h3 style='margin-bottom:2px'>Get 10% off your first order</h3><p class='mini'>Plus early access to closeouts and studio-only pricing.</p><div><label for='e1'>Email address</label><input id='e1' type='email' required placeholder='you@example.com'></div><button class='btn accent wide'>Send my 10% code</button><p class='mini'>No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.</p></form></div></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><a class='logo' href='/' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#9dc3ab'>Direct</span></a><p>Supplying the yoga community with mats and props direct from the source since 1999.</p><h4>Get 10% off your first order</h4><form class='nl' data-thanks='Thanks! Use code WELCOME10 at checkout.'><input type='email' required placeholder='Email address'><button class='btn sm accent'>Get code</button></form></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/shop'>All products</a></li><li><a href='/shop#mats'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='/shop#props'>Blocks &amp; straps</a></li><li><a href='/shop#cushions'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a></li><li><a href='/shop#sale'>Sale</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/faq'>Shipping &amp; returns</a></li><li><a href='/faq'>FAQ</a></li><li><a href='/contact'>Contact us</a></li><li><a href='/cart'>Your cart</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>For business</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale'>Wholesale &amp; bulk</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale'>Studios &amp; gyms</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale'>Schools &amp; nonprofits</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale'>Events &amp; retreats</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'><span>&copy; YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout &middot; Visa &middot; Mastercard &middot; Amex &middot; PayPal</span></div></div></footer><div class='drawer' id='drawer'><div class='bg' onclick='ydClose()'></div><div class='panel'><div class='h'><b>Your cart (<span data-count>0</span>)</b><button class='x' onclick='ydClose()'>close</button></div><div class='pf' style='border-top:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)'><div id='dprog' class='mini'></div><div class='bar'><i id='dbar' style='width:0'></i></div></div><div class='items' id='ditems'></div><div class='pf'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px'><span>Subtotal</span><span data-subtotal>$0.00</span></div><a class='btn wide accent' href='/cart'>Checkout securely</a><p class='mini' style='text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0'>30-day returns &middot; Need 10+? <a href='/wholesale'>Get bulk pricing</a></p></div></div></div><div class='modal' id='pop'><div class='mbox'><button class='close' onclick='ydPop(false)'>&times;</button><h3>Take 10% off your first order</h3><p class='mini'>Join 40,000+ practitioners and studio owners who get our closeout deals first.</p><form data-thanks='You are in! Use code WELCOME10 at checkout.' style='display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:12px'><input type='email' required placeholder='Email address'><button class='btn accent wide'>Email my code</button></form><p class='mini' style='margin-top:10px'><a href='#' onclick='ydPop(false);return false'>No thanks, I&rsquo;ll pay full price</a></p></div></div><script>const YD_P={'mat-deluxe':{n:'Deluxe 1/4 in. Yoga Mat',p:29.95,e:'🧘'},'mat-thick':{n:'Extra Thick 1/2 in. Mat',p:39.95,e:'🧘'},'mat-cork':{n:'Natural Cork Yoga Mat',p:69.95,e:'🌿'},'blocks':{n:'Foam Yoga Blocks (Pair)',p:16.95,e:'🧱'},'strap':{n:'8 ft Cotton Yoga Strap',p:9.95,e:'➰'},'bolster':{n:'Rectangular Cotton Bolster',p:44.95,e:'🛏️'},'blanket':{n:'Mexican Yoga Blanket',p:24.95,e:'🧶'},'wheel':{n:'Cork Yoga Wheel',p:54.95,e:'⭕'},'zafu':{n:'Zafu Meditation Cushion',p:39.95,e:'🪷'},'studio20':{n:'Studio Mat Pack (20 Mats)',p:399,e:'📦'}};const FS=75;function g(){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('yd_cart')||'{}')}catch(e){return{}}}function sv(c){localStorage.setItem('yd_cart',JSON.stringify(c));paint()}function ydAdd(k,q){const c=g();c[k]=(c[k]||0)+(q||1);sv(c);ydOpen()}function ydQty(k,d){const c=g();c[k]=(c[k]||0)+d;if(c[k]<1)delete c[k];sv(c)}function ydRm(k){const c=g();delete c[k];sv(c)}function ydTotal(){const c=g();let t=0;for(const k in c){if(YD_P[k])t+=YD_P[k].p*c[k]}return t}function ydCount(){const c=g();let n=0;for(const k in c)n+=c[k];return n}function money(n){return '$'+n.toFixed(2)}function renderList(id){const el=document.getElementById(id);if(!el)return;const c=g();let h='';for(const k in c){const p=YD_P[k];if(!p)continue;h+=`<div class='it'><div class='th'>${p.e}</div><div style='flex:1'><div style='font-weight:600'>${p.n}</div><div class='mini'>${money(p.p)} each</div><div style='margin-top:4px'><button class='x' onclick='ydQty(\\\"${k}\\\",-1)'>&minus;</button> <b style='margin:0 6px'>${c[k]}</b> <button class='x' onclick='ydQty(\\\"${k}\\\",1)'>+</button> <button class='x' style='margin-left:10px' onclick='ydRm(\\\"${k}\\\")'>remove</button></div></div><div style='font-weight:700'>${money(p.p*c[k])}</div></div>`}el.innerHTML=h||`<p class='mini' style='padding:20px 0'>Your cart is empty. <a href='/shop'>Shop best sellers &rarr;</a></p>`}function paint(){const t=ydTotal(),n=ydCount();document.querySelectorAll('[data-count]').forEach(e=>e.textContent=n);renderList('ditems');renderList('citems');const pr=document.getElementById('dprog');if(pr)pr.innerHTML=t>=FS?'🎉 You have unlocked free shipping!':(n?`Add <b>${money(FS-t)}</b> more for free shipping`:`Free shipping on orders over ${money(FS)}`);const b=document.getElementById('dbar');if(b)b.style.width=Math.min(100,t/FS*100)+'%';document.querySelectorAll('[data-subtotal]').forEach(e=>e.textContent=money(t));const sh=document.getElementById('cship'),gt=document.getElementById('cgrand');if(sh){const s=(t>=FS||t===0)?0:7.95;sh.textContent=s?money(s):'FREE';if(gt)gt.textContent=money(t+s)}}function ydOpen(){document.getElementById('drawer').classList.add('open')}function ydClose(){document.getElementById('drawer').classList.remove('open')}function ydPop(o){const m=document.getElementById('pop');if(m)m.classList[o?'add':'remove']('open');if(o)sessionStorage.setItem('yd_pop','1')}document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('[data-add]');if(b){e.preventDefault();const src=b.getAttribute('data-qty');let q=1;if(src){const el=document.getElementById(src);q=parseInt(el&&el.value)||1}ydAdd(b.getAttribute('data-add'),q)}});document.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=e.target,m=f.getAttribute('data-thanks');if(m)f.innerHTML=`<div class='note'><b>${m}</b></div>`});window.addEventListener('load',()=>{paint();if(!sessionStorage.getItem('yd_pop'))setTimeout(()=>{if(!sessionStorage.getItem('yd_pop'))ydPop(true)},20000)});document.addEventListener('mouseout',e=>{if(e.clientY<6&&!sessionStorage.getItem('yd_pop'))ydPop(true)});</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/shop\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='v