ails.f{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:14px 0}details.f summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;list-style:none}.note{background:var(--sand);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;font-size:14.5px}footer.site{background:var(--ink);color:#cfd8d2;padding:44px 0 22px;font-size:14.5px}footer.site a{text-decoration:none;color:#cfd8d2}footer h4{color:#fff;font-size:15px;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;margin-bottom:10px}.fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:26px}.fgrid ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:7px}.fbot{border-top:1px solid #33453c;margin-top:26px;padding-top:16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px}.nl{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}@media(max-width:900px){.cols,.fgrid,.row2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.g3,.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}nav.main{display:none}.mobnav{display:flex}}</style></head><body><div class='promo'>📦 <b>Same-day bulk quotes</b> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Volume discounts from 10 units &nbsp;·&nbsp; Custom logo mats available</div><header class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='hrow'><a class='logo' href='/'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></a><nav class='main'><a href='/shop'>Shop All</a><a href='/shop#mats'>Mats</a><a href='/shop#props'>Props</a><a class='on' href='/wholesale'>Wholesale &amp; Bulk</a><a href='/about'>About</a><a href='/faq'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a></nav><button class='cartbtn' onclick=\\\"location.href='/cart'\\\">Cart<span class='badge' data-count>0</span></button></div></div><div class='mobnav'><a href='/shop'>Shop All</a><a href='/wholesale'>Wholesale</a><a href='/about'>About</a><a href='/faq'>Shipping</a><a href='/contact'>Contact</a></div></header><section class='hero'><div class='wrap'><div class='cols'><div><div class='eyebrow'>Wholesale &amp; bulk program</div><h1>Outfit your studio for less &mdash; direct from the manufacturer.</h1><p class='lead'>We have supplied studios, gyms, schools, hotels and events since 1999. Send us your list and get a real quote from a real person, usually the same business day.</p><ul class='checks'><li>Save 15&ndash;40% with tiered volume pricing</li><li>Mix and match mats, blocks, straps, bolsters and blankets</li><li>Custom colors and logo-printed mats on 50+ orders</li><li>Freight and pallet shipping across the U.S.</li><li>Net terms available for qualified schools and businesses</li><li>A dedicated rep who knows props, not a ticket queue</li></ul><div class='note'>Not ready for a quote? <a href='/shop'><b>Shop retail pricing &rarr;</b></a> Every order over $75 ships free.</div></div><div><form class='box' data-thanks='Thank you! Your request is in &mdash; a bulk specialist will email your quote, usually within one business day.'><h3 style='margin-bottom:2px'>Get your bulk quote</h3><p class='mini'>Takes 60 seconds. No obligation, no auto-emails from a robot.</p><div class='row2'><div><label for='n'>Name</label><input id='n' required placeholder='Your name'></div><div><label for='o'>Studio / organization</label><input id='o' placeholder='Optional'></div></div><div class='row2'><div><label for='em'>Email</label><input id='em' type='email' required placeholder='you@studio.com'></div><div><label for='ph'>Phone</label><input id='ph' placeholder='Optional'></div></div><div class='row2'><div><label for='ty'>I am buying for</label><select id='ty'><option>Yoga studio</option><option>Gym / fitness center</option><option>School or university</option><option>Event / retreat / festival</option><option>Hotel / wellness center</option><option>Reseller</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div><label for='q'>Estimated quantity</label><select id='q'><option>10&ndash;24 units</option><option>25&ndash;49 units</option><option>50&ndash;99 units</option><option>100+ units</option></select></div></div><div><label for='m'>What do you need?</label><textarea id='m' rows='3' placeholder='e.g. 30 x 1/4 in. mats (mixed colors), 20 pairs of blocks, 20 straps &mdash; needed by March 1'></textarea></div><button class='btn accent wide'>Send my quote request &rarr;</button><p class='mini' style='text-align:center'>Or email us at <b>wholesale@yogadirect.com</b></p></form></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><h2 style='text-align:center'>Volume pricing at a glance</h2><p class='mini' style='text-align:center'>Discounts apply across your whole order &mdash; mix and match products.</p><div class='grid g4' style='margin-top:24px'><div class='tierbox'><div class='big'>15%</div><b>10&ndash;24 units</b><p class='mini'>Perfect for a small studio refresh</p></div><div class='tierbox best'><div class='big'>25%</div><b>25&ndash;49 units</b><p class='mini'>Most popular for full class sets</p></div><div class='tierbox'><div class='big'>35%</div><b>50&ndash;99 units</b><p class='mini'>Includes custom color options</p></div><div class='tierbox'><div class='big'>40%+</div><b>100+ units</b><p class='mini'>Pallet pricing &amp; logo printing</p></div></div><p class='mini' style='text-align:center;margin-top:18px'>Example: 30 Deluxe mats at $29.95 retail = $898. With 25% volume pricing = <b>$673 &mdash; you keep $225.</b></p><div style='text-align:center;margin-top:16px'><a class='btn accent' href='#top' onclick=\\\"window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});return false\\\">Get my quote</a></div></div></section><section class='sec sand'><div class='wrap'><h2>How it works</h2><div class='grid g3'><div class='quote'><b>1. Send your list</b><p class='mini'>Quantities and products &mdash; a rough idea is fine. We will help you spec it.</p></div><div class='quote'><b>2. Get a same-day quote</b><p class='mini'>Itemized pricing, freight cost and lead time, from a specialist who practices.</p></div><div class='quote'><b>3. Ship and reorder easily</b><p class='mini'>We keep your account on file so restocking takes one email.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><h2>Studios that buy direct</h2><div class='grid g3'><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p>&ldquo;We outfitted two rooms &mdash; 60 mats, blocks and straps &mdash; for less than one room cost us before.&rdquo;</p><p class='who'>&mdash; Dana R., studio owner</p></div><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p>&ldquo;Our district ordered props for six schools. Purchase order and net terms were handled without friction.&rdquo;</p><p class='who'>&mdash; Kevin O., PE coordinator</p></div><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p>&ldquo;Logo mats for our retreat arrived early and looked fantastic in photos.&rdquo;</p><p class='who'>&mdash; Lena W., retreat host</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec sand'><div class='wrap'><h2>Wholesale FAQ</h2><details class='f'><summary>Is there a minimum order?</summary><p class='mini'>Volume pricing starts at 10 units. Below that, our regular retail pricing already ships free over $75.</p></details><details class='f'><summary>How fast can you ship a large order?</summary><p class='mini'>Most in-stock bulk orders leave our warehouse in 1&ndash;3 business days. Custom-printed orders typically take 2&ndash;4 weeks.</p></details><details class='f'><summary>Do you offer net terms or purchase orders?</summary><p class='mini'>Yes, for qualified schools, government bodies and established businesses. Ask in your quote request.</p></details><details class='f'><summary>Can I get samples first?</summary><p class='mini'>We can arrange samples on larger projects &mdash; mention it in your request and we will quote sample pricing.</p></details><details class='f'><summary>Do you private-label or drop-ship for resellers?</summary><p class='mini'>Yes for both, subject to volume. Choose &ldquo;Reseller&rdquo; in the form and we will send terms.</p></details></div></section><footer class='site'><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><a class='logo' href='/' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#9dc3ab'>Direct</span></a><p>Supplying the yoga community with mats and props direct from the source since 1999.</p><h4>Get 10% off your first order</h4><form class='nl' data-thanks='Thanks! Use code WELCOME10 at checkout.'><input type='email' required placeholder='Email address'><button class='btn sm accent'>Get code</button></form></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/shop'>All products</a></li><li><a href='/shop#mats'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='/shop#props'>Blocks &amp; straps</a></li><li><a href='/shop#cushions'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/faq'>Shipping &amp; returns</a></li><li><a href='/contact'>Contact us</a></li><li><a href='/cart'>Your cart</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>For business</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale'>Wholesale &amp; bulk</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale'>Studios &amp; gyms</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale'>Schools &amp; events</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'><span>&copy; YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout &middot; Visa &middot; Mastercard &middot; Amex &middot; PayPal</span></div></div></footer><script>function g(){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('yd_cart')||'{}')}catch(e){return{}}}window.addEventListener('load',()=>{const c=g();let n=0;for(const k in c)n+=c[k];document.querySelectorAll('[data-count]').forEach(e=>e.textContent=n)});document.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=e.target,m=f.getAttribute('data-thanks');if(m)f.innerHTML=`<div class='note'><b>${m}</b></div>`});</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/about\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>About YogaDirect | Yoga Mats &amp; Props Since 1999</title><meta name='description' content='YogaDirect has supplied the yoga community since 1999. We manufacture and source our own mats and props so you get high quality gear at direct prices.'><link rel='preconnect' href='https://